(531814, 53767, 509, '<td valign="top">The wake following the watercraft looks great - a nice contrast to the glassy surface of the water.  I''d like to see how a close up of the jetski with the sunset following would look.  Nice job</td>', 'The wake following the watercraft looks great - a nice contrast to the glassy surface of the water.  I''d like to see how a close up of the jetski with the sunset following would look.  Nice job', '2004-01-05 00:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
