(531817, 53304, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, although there are a couple of things to improve.  The wing clipped is a bummer, and the tree behind the lamp is distracting, and the lamp looks slightly tilted to the left.  Could be me though. Nice attempt, and I know ya can''t just get the gull to pose for ya.  The colour of the sky is really nice.  The border might bother some.  I''ve just about given them up on DPC. It''s too hard to please most.</td>', 'Very nice, although there are a couple of things to improve.  The wing clipped is a bummer, and the tree behind the lamp is distracting, and the lamp looks slightly tilted to the left.  Could be me though. Nice attempt, and I know ya can''t just get the gull to pose for ya.  The colour of the sky is really nice.  The border might bother some.  I''ve just about given them up on DPC. It''s too hard to please most.', '2004-01-05 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(531818, 53672, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is either ballet....or a Christmas ornament, but I''m really not sure.  There is definitely something moving, but the action is hard to understand.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is either ballet....or a Christmas ornament, but I''m really not sure.  There is definitely something moving, but the action is hard to understand.', '2004-01-05 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
