(531879, 53325, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh man!  This reminds me of the bald eagle I saw this week, fired off a few shots, then realized after it was too late, that my camera was in macro mode. grrrrr...you did much better than me!</td>', 'Oh man!  This reminds me of the bald eagle I saw this week, fired off a few shots, then realized after it was too late, that my camera was in macro mode. grrrrr...you did much better than me!', '2004-01-05 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
