(532024, 53825, 14401, '<td valign="top">Shame to do that to a perfectly good piggy, LOL!  Nice shot!</td>', 'Shame to do that to a perfectly good piggy, LOL!  Nice shot!', '2004-01-05 06:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(532033, 53666, 14453, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! So unreal!</td>', 'Beautiful! So unreal!', '2004-01-05 06:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(532034, 53660, 4007, '<td valign="top">It looks like a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped you freeze those wings in place, but the focus on the head is great and the shot is still a good one.</td>', 'It looks like a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped you freeze those wings in place, but the focus on the head is great and the shot is still a good one.', '2004-01-05 06:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(532035, 53272, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to have some image quality problems, as such all the detail is muddled here.</td>', 'This shot seems to have some image quality problems, as such all the detail is muddled here.', '2004-01-05 06:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(532036, 53467, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I really like the stances of both of the players in this shot.  Being closer to this surely would have helped this shot, but I''m sure if you could have been closer you would have been.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I really like the stances of both of the players in this shot.  Being closer to this surely would have helped this shot, but I''m sure if you could have been closer you would have been.', '2004-01-05 06:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(532037, 53689, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  The wooden poles framing the shot works beautifully.</td>', 'I like this one.  The wooden poles framing the shot works beautifully.', '2004-01-05 06:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(532038, 53666, 4007, '<td valign="top">Very nice motion capture.  My only gripe is that if you had a lot of tree branches silhouetting the ride it would be a cool effect, but as is the sections at top left are a little distracting.  Probably out of your control, but still a minor detracting point.  Nice choice of subject.  I like the building looming in the background as well.</td>', 'Very nice motion capture.  My only gripe is that if you had a lot of tree branches silhouetting the ride it would be a cool effect, but as is the sections at top left are a little distracting.  Probably out of your control, but still a minor detracting point.  Nice choice of subject.  I like the building looming in the background as well.', '2004-01-05 06:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(532039, 53743, 4007, '<td valign="top">This needs either a crisper focus or a shorter shutter speed because it seems that one or the other is giving it a blurred appearance.  If you could get this come come out sharp as a tack it would be a pretty cool shot.</td>', 'This needs either a crisper focus or a shorter shutter speed because it seems that one or the other is giving it a blurred appearance.  If you could get this come come out sharp as a tack it would be a pretty cool shot.', '2004-01-05 06:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(532040, 53653, 15497, '<td valign="top">This is a actionshot.</td>', 'This is a actionshot.', '2004-01-05 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(532043, 53661, 4007, '<td valign="top">I think the effect here is too much.  There''s really no subject left to the shot.  Were it not for the title I might have been able to tell it was of a sport, but even now I can''t really make out what''s going on in the shot.  In addition, the blur with all the bright colors is almost a bit nauseating to look at.  A good idea gone a bit bad I think.  Nice try though.  I do like the bright colors here and I think the zoom effect wasn''t a bad idea, it just doesn''t work out well in the end here.</td>', 'I think the effect here is too much.  There''s really no subject left to the shot.  Were it not for the title I might have been able to tell it was of a sport, but even now I can''t really make out what''s going on in the shot.  In addition, the blur with all the bright colors is almost a bit nauseating to look at.  A good idea gone a bit bad I think.  Nice try though.  I do like the bright colors here and I think the zoom effect wasn''t a bad idea, it just doesn''t work out well in the end here.', '2004-01-05 07:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(532044, 53152, 4007, '<td valign="top">This pushes the definition of action.  And it seems that you''ve pumped the saturation up way too far on this shot, as the colors now look unnatural.</td>', 'This pushes the definition of action.  And it seems that you''ve pumped the saturation up way too far on this shot, as the colors now look unnatural.', '2004-01-05 07:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(532045, 53653, 4007, '<td valign="top">There''s gotta be a story behind this one, and I''m looking forward to hearing it. Nice work.</td>', 'There''s gotta be a story behind this one, and I''m looking forward to hearing it. Nice work.', '2004-01-05 07:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
