(532092, 53751, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I like the light on the horizon. Looks like the sun rising in the east.</td>', 'Good idea. I like the light on the horizon. Looks like the sun rising in the east.', '2004-01-05 08:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(532096, 53689, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea for this shot, well done.  I like the motion of the chair, the wooden beams etc. 9<br/> <br/>A few other things to try though...  Have a faster shutter speed to get the chair that''s moving perfectly still, but at the same angle as you have?<br/> <br/>Maybe have the chair on the right-hand side?<br/> <br/>Just my ideas though.</td>', 'I really like the idea for this shot, well done.  I like the motion of the chair, the wooden beams etc. 9 A few other things to try though...  Have a faster shutter speed to get the chair that''s moving perfectly still, but at the same angle as you have? Maybe have the chair on the right-hand side? Just my ideas though.', '2004-01-05 08:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(532098, 52925, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is an OK shot. It is difficult to get a good one of these unless you have a telescopic site or you are really close. The pole in the lower left is distracting, the focus is off and the sky is too speckled.  The U shape of the birds with the 3 in the middle is an interesting pattern. Hope this helps.</td>', 'This is an OK shot. It is difficult to get a good one of these unless you have a telescopic site or you are really close. The pole in the lower left is distracting, the focus is off and the sky is too speckled.  The U shape of the birds with the 3 in the middle is an interesting pattern. Hope this helps.', '2004-01-05 08:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(532100, 53834, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really like this, the feeling of action and motion are really good.  Cropped maybe a little too much at his feet though.</td>', 'Really like this, the feeling of action and motion are really good.  Cropped maybe a little too much at his feet though.', '2004-01-05 08:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(532101, 53834, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good feeling of movement. Good exposure time. This is not an easy shot to get such a clear colors against the white backround with a long exposure time.</td>', 'Good feeling of movement. Good exposure time. This is not an easy shot to get such a clear colors against the white backround with a long exposure time.', '2004-01-05 08:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(532102, 52844, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice long exposure shot here.<br/> <br/>Would have been nicer if we could have seen the whole table, and as a portrait shot.</td>', 'Great idea, nice long exposure shot here. Would have been nicer if we could have seen the whole table, and as a portrait shot.', '2004-01-05 08:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(532104, 53643, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of motion. He looks like he is really trying to get that bike moving.</td>', 'Nice feeling of motion. He looks like he is really trying to get that bike moving.', '2004-01-05 08:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(532106, 53477, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good feeling of motion. The girl above is taking attention away from your subject. It is always difficult to control these things when you are taking a \"captured\" image.</td>', 'Good feeling of motion. The girl above is taking attention away from your subject. It is always difficult to control these things when you are taking a \"captured\" image.', '2004-01-05 08:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(532109, 53836, 12802, '<td valign="top">OK, how''s the gold tee being held up???<br/> <br/>Good shot, good take on the challenge.</td>', 'OK, how''s the gold tee being held up??? Good shot, good take on the challenge.', '2004-01-05 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(532110, 53836, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good try at a difficult shot. I like the backround color. It sets off the subject well. There is an oversaturated white spot on the ball which I realize is difficult to avoid due to the exposure time. I wish the club was a little sharper at the point of impact. Interesting idea to show the entire T as opposed to having it sticking in the ground.</td>', 'Good try at a difficult shot. I like the backround color. It sets off the subject well. There is an oversaturated white spot on the ball which I realize is difficult to avoid due to the exposure time. I wish the club was a little sharper at the point of impact. Interesting idea to show the entire T as opposed to having it sticking in the ground.', '2004-01-05 08:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(532113, 53777, 12802, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little longer exposure would have showed better motion with the ball, or even the skittles being knocked over?<br/> <br/>A great idea for the challenge, I can see a little motion in the ball so that''s good.</td>', 'Maybe a little longer exposure would have showed better motion with the ball, or even the skittles being knocked over? A great idea for the challenge, I can see a little motion in the ball so that''s good.', '2004-01-05 08:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(532115, 53656, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting action shot. Looks like they are arguing over who is ''alpha". I think I would have liked the shot better if you could have cropped in a little closer on the birds but I see they are already oversaturated and somewhat out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting action shot. Looks like they are arguing over who is ''alpha". I think I would have liked the shot better if you could have cropped in a little closer on the birds but I see they are already oversaturated and somewhat out of focus.', '2004-01-05 08:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(532116, 53787, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really like this, so simple, yet can feel the action of the surfer.  Might have benefitted with a border round the picture?  While I like the plain sea at the top, I think it stops too suddenly, a subtle border may have helped this. 9</td>', 'Really like this, so simple, yet can feel the action of the surfer.  Might have benefitted with a border round the picture?  While I like the plain sea at the top, I think it stops too suddenly, a subtle border may have helped this. 9', '2004-01-05 08:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(532118, 53826, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a good action shot. I realize it is difficult to control the backround in a captured shot but I find the telephone poll and the bottom of the house above distracting. I think I would have liked your picture better if the entire shadow was included.</td>', 'This is a good action shot. I realize it is difficult to control the backround in a captured shot but I find the telephone poll and the bottom of the house above distracting. I think I would have liked your picture better if the entire shadow was included.', '2004-01-05 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(532119, 53821, 3306, '<td valign="top">I get your message. Looks like the dinosaur is chasing the boy. Satisfies the challenge.</td>', 'I get your message. Looks like the dinosaur is chasing the boy. Satisfies the challenge.', '2004-01-05 08:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(532121, 53837, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Good action shot but it gives the impression that the player is playing alone. Should have had a hand on the handle in the foreground and it would have given the impression of a competition.</td>', 'I like the idea. Good action shot but it gives the impression that the player is playing alone. Should have had a hand on the handle in the foreground and it would have given the impression of a competition.', '2004-01-05 08:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(532123, 53755, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. Would have been more fun to look at if you could have cropped in closer without a view of the ground. Then the viewer could imagine how far they were going to fall before they hit bottom!</td>', 'Good action shot. Would have been more fun to look at if you could have cropped in closer without a view of the ground. Then the viewer could imagine how far they were going to fall before they hit bottom!', '2004-01-05 08:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532126, 53644, 12802, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot here, the reflections in the water are great.  <br/> <br/>Don''t get much of an action feeling though. Your title to me suggests a lazy night of fishing, the calm water doesn''t show much going on.</td>', 'Brilliant shot here, the reflections in the water are great.   Don''t get much of an action feeling though. Your title to me suggests a lazy night of fishing, the calm water doesn''t show much going on.', '2004-01-05 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532127, 53825, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow, This is an amazing shot!  Don''t tell me you got this on the first try?  You must have alot of little pigs lying around. :-)  Great capture!  How''d you get the pig to explode outward like that? 9!</td>', 'Wow, This is an amazing shot!  Don''t tell me you got this on the first try?  You must have alot of little pigs lying around. :-)  Great capture!  How''d you get the pig to explode outward like that? 9!', '2004-01-05 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532131, 52844, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light on the balls tracks the path of each of the balls.</td>', 'I like the way the light on the balls tracks the path of each of the balls.', '2004-01-05 08:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(532132, 53039, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good stop action of the pigeon.</td>', 'Good stop action of the pigeon.', '2004-01-05 08:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(532135, 53753, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. Excellent color. interesting swirling feel. The eye is drawn to the fish in the middle with his mouth open.</td>', 'Good action shot. Excellent color. interesting swirling feel. The eye is drawn to the fish in the middle with his mouth open.', '2004-01-05 08:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(532137, 53471, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good feeling of movement of the water. Since this is the subject of the picture, I would have cropped out more of the top landscape to just above where the stream goes out of sight.</td>', 'Good feeling of movement of the water. Since this is the subject of the picture, I would have cropped out more of the top landscape to just above where the stream goes out of sight.', '2004-01-05 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(532149, 53644, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, boat well placed.  Would have liked more action</td>', 'Nicely composed, boat well placed.  Would have liked more action', '2004-01-05 09:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(532150, 53727, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of action from the- flowing manes.</td>', 'Nice sense of action from the- flowing manes.', '2004-01-05 09:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(532151, 53758, 14614, '<td valign="top">Creative action shot, really like the title. Perhaps some blurring of the fingers would tie better to the theme.  Overall well done.</td>', 'Creative action shot, really like the title. Perhaps some blurring of the fingers would tie better to the theme.  Overall well done.', '2004-01-05 09:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(532153, 53725, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a great shot here.  Like the yellow against the gray, look of concentration is perfect, swirling waters add the element of movement.</td>', 'You''ve captured a great shot here.  Like the yellow against the gray, look of concentration is perfect, swirling waters add the element of movement.', '2004-01-05 09:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(532154, 53756, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and frozen in time - great interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'Nicely lit and frozen in time - great interpretation of the theme.', '2004-01-05 09:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(532160, 53477, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the action from the girl in pink - other swinger draws attention away - may be better if the background was less busy.</td>', 'Like the action from the girl in pink - other swinger draws attention away - may be better if the background was less busy.', '2004-01-05 09:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(532162, 53719, 14614, '<td valign="top">Could be my eyes but plane looks soft.  Like the propeller motion and the composition.</td>', 'Could be my eyes but plane looks soft.  Like the propeller motion and the composition.', '2004-01-05 09:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(532163, 53744, 14614, '<td valign="top">Could be my eyes but the guitar looks soft.  Like the movement in the hand and the composition</td>', 'Could be my eyes but the guitar looks soft.  Like the movement in the hand and the composition', '2004-01-05 09:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(532186, 53039, 6740, '<td valign="top">Best shot of the bunch. Congrats</td>', 'Best shot of the bunch. Congrats', '2004-01-05 09:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(532188, 52780, 5999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice focus and dof. You really caught a moment here.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice focus and dof. You really caught a moment here.Mark', '2004-01-05 09:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(532189, 53363, 14614, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and interpretation of the theme.  A bit picky but the boarder cuts off the photo on the right but the microphone extends past it on the left - showing the editiing.</td>', 'Good exposure and interpretation of the theme.  A bit picky but the boarder cuts off the photo on the right but the microphone extends past it on the left - showing the editiing.', '2004-01-05 09:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(532191, 53826, 14614, '<td valign="top">Certainly has the action.  Would have liked some cropping on the sides.</td>', 'Certainly has the action.  Would have liked some cropping on the sides.', '2004-01-05 09:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(532194, 53489, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the focual point is a bit too dark</td>', 'Nice composition but the focual point is a bit too dark', '2004-01-05 10:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(532212, 53839, 14401, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Good action!</td>', 'Neat shot.  Good action!', '2004-01-05 10:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(532214, 53642, 14614, '<td valign="top">Clear focal point and nice composition.  I need to see some movement - looks like he''s just standing on the snow.  Perhaps if the ground looked more like a hill?</td>', 'Clear focal point and nice composition.  I need to see some movement - looks like he''s just standing on the snow.  Perhaps if the ground looked more like a hill?', '2004-01-05 10:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(532215, 53694, 6008, '<td valign="top">Colors are great, sharpness is good, shows action very well. If I were to nitpick I''d probably say more room on the right and less on the left, but still an excellent shot.</td>', 'Colors are great, sharpness is good, shows action very well. If I were to nitpick I''d probably say more room on the right and less on the left, but still an excellent shot.', '2004-01-05 10:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(532216, 53692, 14401, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!  Like the blurred edges.</td>', 'Great action shot!  Like the blurred edges.', '2004-01-05 10:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(532218, 53831, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of black and white, it sets the mood very well. I get the feeling of action with the cycle moving, but there is also a feeling of calm as well. Sharpness and dof are good. Very atmospheric.</td>', 'I like the choice of black and white, it sets the mood very well. I get the feeling of action with the cycle moving, but there is also a feeling of calm as well. Sharpness and dof are good. Very atmospheric.', '2004-01-05 10:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(532219, 53649, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.</td>', 'Very cool shot.', '2004-01-05 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(532220, 52646, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like this.. it has a great atmosphere to it. The snow is a little blown out on the top of the hill, but I dont think it detracts too much as it has a wide tonal range. Some may say the people are too centered, but I think it''s a classic look and style - a study of human nature. Well captured.</td>', 'I like this.. it has a great atmosphere to it. The snow is a little blown out on the top of the hill, but I dont think it detracts too much as it has a wide tonal range. Some may say the people are too centered, but I think it''s a classic look and style - a study of human nature. Well captured.', '2004-01-05 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532221, 53677, 14614, '<td valign="top">BRRRRR.  The is action!  Great freeze-frame (no pun intended) of the woman. (minor) something about the other body detracts from the compostion - maybe seeing more of the person would help.</td>', 'BRRRRR.  The is action!  Great freeze-frame (no pun intended) of the woman. (minor) something about the other body detracts from the compostion - maybe seeing more of the person would help.', '2004-01-05 10:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(532222, 53727, 14401, '<td valign="top">Lovely horses, good action.  I might have tried to get a better angle or background, but then I wasn''t there, was I?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Lovely horses, good action.  I might have tried to get a better angle or background, but then I wasn''t there, was I?  Nice shot.', '2004-01-05 10:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(532223, 53757, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the double meaning in the title.  A manicure may have helped ;-)  Fingers seem soft</td>', 'Like the double meaning in the title.  A manicure may have helped ;-)  Fingers seem soft', '2004-01-05 10:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(532224, 53359, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - nicely composed and perfectly times.  I think the white boarder detracts - yellow may have been a better choice.</td>', 'I like this shot - nicely composed and perfectly times.  I think the white boarder detracts - yellow may have been a better choice.', '2004-01-05 10:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(532226, 53749, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear shot. Good choce of bacground, excellent long exposure.</td>', 'Nice and clear shot. Good choce of bacground, excellent long exposure.', '2004-01-05 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(532227, 52863, 12802, '<td valign="top">Cool, very good shot here!</td>', 'Cool, very good shot here!', '2004-01-05 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(532228, 53680, 6008, '<td valign="top">A tad soft but not distractingly so as it sets a nice mood. A little blown out on the left part of the body, but otherwise excellent lighting. Great capture of action with the water droplets and the meal without introducing any blur. Good composition, I like the addition of the rock with the shell. Although now that I look at it longer I wonder if there was too much (if any) burning on the neck to avoid overexposure.</td>', 'A tad soft but not distractingly so as it sets a nice mood. A little blown out on the left part of the body, but otherwise excellent lighting. Great capture of action with the water droplets and the meal without introducing any blur. Good composition, I like the addition of the rock with the shell. Although now that I look at it longer I wonder if there was too much (if any) burning on the neck to avoid overexposure.', '2004-01-05 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532229, 53831, 14401, '<td valign="top">A little dark.  Adjusting contrast/light would make this a bit better IMHO.</td>', 'A little dark.  Adjusting contrast/light would make this a bit better IMHO.', '2004-01-05 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(532233, 53666, 12802, '<td valign="top">Like the almost flourescent blues in this shot.  Good idea to show the building in the background.  <br/> <br/>Maybe could have cloned out the street lamp on the right hand side?</td>', 'Like the almost flourescent blues in this shot.  Good idea to show the building in the background.   Maybe could have cloned out the street lamp on the right hand side?', '2004-01-05 10:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(532234, 53734, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great composition and wonderful stop action on the water. The flesh tones are wonderfully even and well lit, and the overall shot is very sharp. Good idea and good execution.</td>', 'Great composition and wonderful stop action on the water. The flesh tones are wonderfully even and well lit, and the overall shot is very sharp. Good idea and good execution.', '2004-01-05 10:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(532236, 53734, 14110, '<td valign="top">awesome idea, this is really a great action shot~9<br/></td>', 'awesome idea, this is really a great action shot~9', '2004-01-05 10:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532238, 53838, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, like the idea of having a different coloured spinning top just sitting there.</td>', 'Good DOF, like the idea of having a different coloured spinning top just sitting there.', '2004-01-05 10:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(532239, 53689, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and shot. Reminds me of those executive toys with the balls that you swing. Colors are great, the natural framing of the poles is nicely presented too. A good technical shot showing the dynamics of action.</td>', 'Interesting idea and shot. Reminds me of those executive toys with the balls that you swing. Colors are great, the natural framing of the poles is nicely presented too. A good technical shot showing the dynamics of action.', '2004-01-05 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(532241, 53643, 14110, '<td valign="top">i love this shot-how the child stands out and the background is so blurred...great job*8</td>', 'i love this shot-how the child stands out and the background is so blurred...great job*8', '2004-01-05 10:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(532244, 53734, 14401, '<td valign="top">Cute, pixie-ish model - good capture.</td>', 'Cute, pixie-ish model - good capture.', '2004-01-05 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(532249, 53325, 14401, '<td valign="top">Hard to capture these guys sharply - I know first hand!  So, the image is a bit blurry.</td>', 'Hard to capture these guys sharply - I know first hand!  So, the image is a bit blurry.', '2004-01-05 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532250, 53826, 14401, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  I''d like this one better a little less centered with entire shadow in the frame.</td>', 'Good capture.  I''d like this one better a little less centered with entire shadow in the frame.', '2004-01-05 10:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(532256, 53428, 6130, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-01-05 11:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(532258, 53325, 6130, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-01-05 11:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(532265, 53831, 13136, '<td valign="top">I love the use of B&amp;W in this shot. Isolated action subject is good.</td>', 'I love the use of B&W in this shot. Isolated action subject is good.', '2004-01-05 11:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(532267, 53705, 13136, '<td valign="top">Looks like he is sitting in the water. Good stop on the water action.</td>', 'Looks like he is sitting in the water. Good stop on the water action.', '2004-01-05 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(532272, 53431, 13136, '<td valign="top">Are you stirring with the olives? Reflextions near the top of the shot are distracting. Crisp, clear shot.</td>', 'Are you stirring with the olives? Reflextions near the top of the shot are distracting. Crisp, clear shot.', '2004-01-05 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(532273, 53471, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally care for the thick blocky black border with this shot, makes it feel to closed in. 7</td>', 'I don''t personally care for the thick blocky black border with this shot, makes it feel to closed in. 7', '2004-01-05 11:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(532276, 53272, 6668, '<td valign="top">The glare in his eye is very distracting in my opinion.</td>', 'The glare in his eye is very distracting in my opinion.', '2004-01-05 11:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(532278, 53499, 13136, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great shot. Should place top 5 if not 1.</td>', 'Wow. Great shot. Should place top 5 if not 1.', '2004-01-05 11:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(532280, 53656, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems a bit grainy and out of focus to me, maybe adjusting brightness and contrast could help a little, the colors seems a little flat. 5</td>', 'seems a bit grainy and out of focus to me, maybe adjusting brightness and contrast could help a little, the colors seems a little flat. 5', '2004-01-05 11:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(532281, 53119, 13136, '<td valign="top">I assume the flash is the action in this shot. Good job of capturing it. Not really sure how "Action" it is.</td>', 'I assume the flash is the action in this shot. Good job of capturing it. Not really sure how "Action" it is.', '2004-01-05 11:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(532283, 53694, 13136, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clear, good focus and lighting.</td>', 'Crisp, clear, good focus and lighting.', '2004-01-05 11:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(532285, 53680, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I can see the drops of water that show the grab had just been made. Good catch.</td>', 'Nice shot. I can see the drops of water that show the grab had just been made. Good catch.', '2004-01-05 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(532286, 53753, 13136, '<td valign="top">Lots of action in this shot. I like how all the fish, but one are in furious motion.</td>', 'Lots of action in this shot. I like how all the fish, but one are in furious motion.', '2004-01-05 11:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(532291, 53742, 13136, '<td valign="top">Strange, but the smearing almost looks like they are going uphill instead of down. Nice shot.</td>', 'Strange, but the smearing almost looks like they are going uphill instead of down. Nice shot.', '2004-01-05 11:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(532294, 53749, 13136, '<td valign="top">Might be better if shutter speed was faster to show 1/4 to 1/2 of a revolution instead of multiple. Good concept, lighting and framing. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Might be better if shutter speed was faster to show 1/4 to 1/2 of a revolution instead of multiple. Good concept, lighting and framing. Interesting shot.', '2004-01-05 11:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(532295, 53737, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Almost looks like multiple exposure of one bird.</td>', 'Nice catch. Almost looks like multiple exposure of one bird.', '2004-01-05 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(532297, 52842, 13136, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what the act is. Police pushing a little boy?</td>', 'Can''t really tell what the act is. Police pushing a little boy?', '2004-01-05 11:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(532299, 53839, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good catch. Maybe a bit overexposed? Lots of action in addition to main subject. Cool shot.</td>', 'Good catch. Maybe a bit overexposed? Lots of action in addition to main subject. Cool shot.', '2004-01-05 11:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(532301, 53778, 13136, '<td valign="top">Mid-air shot may have been better, but you can''t always get pets to cooperate. Nice shot, even catching snowflake action as well as dog action.</td>', 'Mid-air shot may have been better, but you can''t always get pets to cooperate. Nice shot, even catching snowflake action as well as dog action.', '2004-01-05 11:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(532304, 53744, 13136, '<td valign="top">Maybe need to brace the guitar so only the hand and strings are in motion? I wanted to do this, but couldn''t do it as well as you did.</td>', 'Maybe need to brace the guitar so only the hand and strings are in motion? I wanted to do this, but couldn''t do it as well as you did.', '2004-01-05 11:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(532305, 53692, 7543, '<td valign="top">It looks way too fake, the black halo around the guy is distracting. Would like to see the original rules in place here.</td>', 'It looks way too fake, the black halo around the guy is distracting. Would like to see the original rules in place here.', '2004-01-05 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(532308, 53756, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great motion capture. Nice DOF and lighting, like the shadows from the wings. Good tight crop, I would have left a few pixels under the birds feet if possible. Nice job.</td>', 'Great motion capture. Nice DOF and lighting, like the shadows from the wings. Good tight crop, I would have left a few pixels under the birds feet if possible. Nice job.', '2004-01-05 11:52:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(532311, 53649, 13136, '<td valign="top">BEER! Or is it scotch? Lots of motion here. Great stop action shot.</td>', 'BEER! Or is it scotch? Lots of motion here. Great stop action shot.', '2004-01-05 11:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(532314, 53439, 7543, '<td valign="top">Looks like you put some texture on top of the image and it doesn''t do it for me. Great timing, nice to see the flames coming out of the barrel. I would have done less "photo-shopping" on this one (given that the original was good enough, you can''t really tell how the original quality of the shot is.</td>', 'Looks like you put some texture on top of the image and it doesn''t do it for me. Great timing, nice to see the flames coming out of the barrel. I would have done less "photo-shopping" on this one (given that the original was good enough, you can''t really tell how the original quality of the shot is.', '2004-01-05 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(532320, 52844, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! like the "flare" lines from the shining balls. Maybe the crop could have covered the whole table, but that might take some "thunder" from the real subject? Nice</td>', 'Nice idea! like the "flare" lines from the shining balls. Maybe the crop could have covered the whole table, but that might take some "thunder" from the real subject? Nice', '2004-01-05 11:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(532322, 52780, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good stop action. Color, focus, lighting and framing all good. Should finish high.</td>', 'Good stop action. Color, focus, lighting and framing all good. Should finish high.', '2004-01-05 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(532325, 53833, 13136, '<td valign="top">The color on this is strange. It almost looks like you are pouring water into milk. Ripples are a bit small and undistinguished.</td>', 'The color on this is strange. It almost looks like you are pouring water into milk. Ripples are a bit small and undistinguished.', '2004-01-05 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(532328, 53729, 13136, '<td valign="top">Ooh, ooh. Power tools! Good shot.</td>', 'Ooh, ooh. Power tools! Good shot.', '2004-01-05 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(532331, 53142, 13136, '<td valign="top">Might have made this vertical and taller.</td>', 'Might have made this vertical and taller.', '2004-01-05 12:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(532332, 52844, 13136, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do this, but it would not have come out as good as yours. Good shot. The spot reflections that drew bright lines help make this better.</td>', 'I wanted to do this, but it would not have come out as good as yours. Good shot. The spot reflections that drew bright lines help make this better.', '2004-01-05 12:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(532334, 53689, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Nice action, and good natural framing with the post. My favorite for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Nice action, and good natural framing with the post. My favorite for this challenge.', '2004-01-05 12:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(532335, 52844, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Maybe too busy, but it definitely has a lot of action.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Maybe too busy, but it definitely has a lot of action.', '2004-01-05 12:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(532337, 53840, 7543, '<td valign="top">Didn''t make out the snow flakes at first, the title helped my slow mind out... Great idea, wish I had thought of it myself. Simple, yet beautiful shot!</td>', 'Didn''t make out the snow flakes at first, the title helped my slow mind out... Great idea, wish I had thought of it myself. Simple, yet beautiful shot!', '2004-01-05 12:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(532338, 53359, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot. I''ll have to learn how to do that someday.</td>', 'Excellent action shot. I''ll have to learn how to do that someday.', '2004-01-05 12:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(532340, 53787, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of sepia. Good negative space on top. Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting use of sepia. Good negative space on top. Nice shot.', '2004-01-05 12:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(532342, 53147, 10047, '<td valign="top">Difficult to tell if there is action or the shot is blurry. Maybe if the photo wasn''t cropped so tight it would be easier to tell.</td>', 'Difficult to tell if there is action or the shot is blurry. Maybe if the photo wasn''t cropped so tight it would be easier to tell.', '2004-01-05 12:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
