(532766, 53777, 509, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but I think it could be done better.  I would have tried to keep the gutter out of the frame (no pun intended).  To me, it looks like digital zoom was used.  It lends to the grainy appearance.  Finally, if you had captured the ball making an impact on the pins, sending them in the air, in different directions, etc, the picture would better embody the "action" description.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but I think it could be done better.  I would have tried to keep the gutter out of the frame (no pun intended).  To me, it looks like digital zoom was used.  It lends to the grainy appearance.  Finally, if you had captured the ball making an impact on the pins, sending them in the air, in different directions, etc, the picture would better embody the "action" description.', '2004-01-05 18:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
