(533245, 53692, 4338, '<td valign="top">to me this image looks like it has had way too much editing done to it. maybe a milder touch on the editing would have resulted in a photo that does not look too fake</td>', 'to me this image looks like it has had way too much editing done to it. maybe a milder touch on the editing would have resulted in a photo that does not look too fake', '2004-01-06 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
