(533419, 53689, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very simple idea and I love it.  The colors are great and so is the angle from which you shot it at. Excellent DOF!</td>', 'This is a very simple idea and I love it.  The colors are great and so is the angle from which you shot it at. Excellent DOF!', '2004-01-06 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
