(533423, 53439, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great action to capture but it''s just too blurry and too oversharpened.  Nice try though. :-)</td>', 'Great action to capture but it''s just too blurry and too oversharpened.  Nice try though. :-)', '2004-01-06 12:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
