(533465, 53838, 14401, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors - good catch!</td>', 'Nice bright colors - good catch!', '2004-01-06 13:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(533468, 53644, 5508, '<td valign="top">not to much action here but a great shot.</td>', 'not to much action here but a great shot.', '2004-01-06 13:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(533472, 53760, 14401, '<td valign="top">Interesting.   Colors aren''t my favorite perhaps - but I think the main thing is that troubles me about this one is that my mind wants to know "why?"  I was sort of expecting to see ice/skates or something.  The expression on your model doesn''t give me any clues, either.</td>', 'Interesting.   Colors aren''t my favorite perhaps - but I think the main thing is that troubles me about this one is that my mind wants to know "why?"  I was sort of expecting to see ice/skates or something.  The expression on your model doesn''t give me any clues, either.', '2004-01-06 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(533473, 53676, 14401, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a sharper focus here.</td>', 'Would like to see a sharper focus here.', '2004-01-06 13:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(533475, 53756, 14401, '<td valign="top">Great capture of this gull!  Very sharp.  Would like to see just a smidge more space under the feet, but otherwise nice cropping.</td>', 'Great capture of this gull!  Very sharp.  Would like to see just a smidge more space under the feet, but otherwise nice cropping.', '2004-01-06 13:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(533476, 53152, 14401, '<td valign="top">Lovely mallards!  I''d take the saturation down just a smidgeon, but the subjects are nice and sharp.</td>', 'Lovely mallards!  I''d take the saturation down just a smidgeon, but the subjects are nice and sharp.', '2004-01-06 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(533480, 53752, 15679, '<td valign="top">What is a nice shot?  When it leaves you feeling and wanting to be in that place at that time. This shot does that for me.  Flying freely.</td>', 'What is a nice shot?  When it leaves you feeling and wanting to be in that place at that time. This shot does that for me.  Flying freely.', '2004-01-06 13:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(533483, 53431, 15679, '<td valign="top">This photo made me smile. :)  Paired with the title...adorably clever.</td>', 'This photo made me smile. :)  Paired with the title...adorably clever.', '2004-01-06 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(533484, 53725, 15679, '<td valign="top">This photo describes the subject of the challange for me. Great shot.</td>', 'This photo describes the subject of the challange for me. Great shot.', '2004-01-06 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(533487, 53644, 15679, '<td valign="top">I think this shot simply put,  draws you right in as if you were sitting lakeside watching.</td>', 'I think this shot simply put,  draws you right in as if you were sitting lakeside watching.', '2004-01-06 13:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(533488, 53767, 15679, '<td valign="top">One word. Beautiful!</td>', 'One word. Beautiful!', '2004-01-06 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(533494, 53142, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think this requires a picture in vertical orientation, taken from lower to the ground, to add height, to increase the impact on the viewer.</td>', 'I think this requires a picture in vertical orientation, taken from lower to the ground, to add height, to increase the impact on the viewer.', '2004-01-06 14:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(533495, 53787, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great shot, calm and powerful, composition is perfect and I love your coloring, almost copper.</td>', 'Great shot, calm and powerful, composition is perfect and I love your coloring, almost copper.', '2004-01-06 14:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(533496, 53834, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-01-06 14:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(533503, 53835, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good action stop, but I think this shot requires some more contrast, more careful lighting. If you would have placed dark surfaces left and right then both the glass and the drops would be much better defined. Also the icecube is already to far down.</td>', 'Good action stop, but I think this shot requires some more contrast, more careful lighting. If you would have placed dark surfaces left and right then both the glass and the drops would be much better defined. Also the icecube is already to far down.', '2004-01-06 14:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(533505, 53821, 4008, '<td valign="top">Looks like the surface is loose ground. In that case you should have covered the plate the dino is standing on to increase the suggestion it is alive.</td>', 'Looks like the surface is loose ground. In that case you should have covered the plate the dino is standing on to increase the suggestion it is alive.', '2004-01-06 14:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(533507, 53839, 4008, '<td valign="top">great catch, good to include the village in the picture to add dimension.</td>', 'great catch, good to include the village in the picture to add dimension.', '2004-01-06 14:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(533509, 53752, 4008, '<td valign="top">A beauty.  Good colors, good composition, good sharpness of the seagulls.</td>', 'A beauty.  Good colors, good composition, good sharpness of the seagulls.', '2004-01-06 14:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(533512, 53742, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to pan with the movement, and get the surroundings blurred but the children sharp. But I know how difficult it is (and not get hit !!).</td>', 'I would have tried to pan with the movement, and get the surroundings blurred but the children sharp. But I know how difficult it is (and not get hit !!).', '2004-01-06 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(533516, 53822, 4008, '<td valign="top">Who is Mr.Lebowski ? A goldfish ? I see some orange color and lots of movement in the water, but don''t know what the message of the image is.</td>', 'Who is Mr.Lebowski ? A goldfish ? I see some orange color and lots of movement in the water, but don''t know what the message of the image is.', '2004-01-06 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(533527, 53834, 4008, '<td valign="top">Too photoshopped for my liking. And the all important skates are partly outside the picture.</td>', 'Too photoshopped for my liking. And the all important skates are partly outside the picture.', '2004-01-06 14:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(533533, 53692, 14477, '<td valign="top">I like the 3D look</td>', 'I like the 3D look', '2004-01-06 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(533535, 53777, 14477, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like this better if you''d taken the shot just when the pins were hit.</td>', 'I think I would have like this better if you''d taken the shot just when the pins were hit.', '2004-01-06 14:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(533617, 53826, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture but more attention needs to be paid to background and position of elements in it. In this case I feel that the position of the post on the opposite pavement (UK for sidewalk) interrupts the outline of the skateboarder. I think composition also needs attention - this might work better in portrait and would benefit from additional space at the top to balance that at the bottom and ensure the skater''s hand were not chopped off.</td>', 'Nice motion capture but more attention needs to be paid to background and position of elements in it. In this case I feel that the position of the post on the opposite pavement (UK for sidewalk) interrupts the outline of the skateboarder. I think composition also needs attention - this might work better in portrait and would benefit from additional space at the top to balance that at the bottom and ensure the skater''s hand were not chopped off.', '2004-01-06 16:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(533619, 53539, 3087, '<td valign="top">Aaaaaaaaaaaaaw that''s just lovely. This image doesn''t necessarily shout "Action" to me - I think "motion" shots can do that more effectively. But this image has undeniably captured an intimate action that was just a moment in time. Composition is strong, close crop works well, background colours complement foreground subjects and I like the reduced colour palette that results.</td>', 'Aaaaaaaaaaaaaw that''s just lovely. This image doesn''t necessarily shout "Action" to me - I think "motion" shots can do that more effectively. But this image has undeniably captured an intimate action that was just a moment in time. Composition is strong, close crop works well, background colours complement foreground subjects and I like the reduced colour palette that results.', '2004-01-06 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(533621, 53725, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good capture of motion - I like that you''ve got the canoeist face on and even have some eye contact. I''ve seen a lot of shots of this sport where that has not been achieved. In this case it helps communicate his determination and concentration. I''d crop a little more tightly at the left but otherwise, I think composition is good, aided by the rock and the diagonal of the oar.</td>', 'Good capture of motion - I like that you''ve got the canoeist face on and even have some eye contact. I''ve seen a lot of shots of this sport where that has not been achieved. In this case it helps communicate his determination and concentration. I''d crop a little more tightly at the left but otherwise, I think composition is good, aided by the rock and the diagonal of the oar.', '2004-01-06 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(533622, 53787, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual surfing shot - a very different feel from most. I think the strongest element here is the composition - the slightly diagonal line of the wave is very very strong and the position of the surfer cuts is just at the right point. This is a great example of a composition that doesn''t use the rule of thirds but works superbly. I like the choice to go black and white but find the tone too pink.</td>', 'What an unusual surfing shot - a very different feel from most. I think the strongest element here is the composition - the slightly diagonal line of the wave is very very strong and the position of the surfer cuts is just at the right point. This is a great example of a composition that doesn''t use the rule of thirds but works superbly. I like the choice to go black and white but find the tone too pink.', '2004-01-06 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(533623, 53737, 3087, '<td valign="top">Image quality seems very low with noise in the sky particularly visible. The image itself I like - the difference in scale between the relatively nearby birds and the distant bridge and shore adds interest.</td>', 'Image quality seems very low with noise in the sky particularly visible. The image itself I like - the difference in scale between the relatively nearby birds and the distant bridge and shore adds interest.', '2004-01-06 16:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(533624, 53649, 3087, '<td valign="top">Mmmm! A very pretty abstract that conveys the theme but also provides mesmerizing colours and shapes to become lost in.</td>', 'Mmmm! A very pretty abstract that conveys the theme but also provides mesmerizing colours and shapes to become lost in.', '2004-01-06 16:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(533625, 53743, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. Some intriguing shapes captured.</td>', 'Nicely lit. Some intriguing shapes captured.', '2004-01-06 16:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(533626, 53748, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way most of the model is still and only some is in motion. The stark wall and vivid colours give a slightly off-balance feel which is interesting.</td>', 'I like the way most of the model is still and only some is in motion. The stark wall and vivid colours give a slightly off-balance feel which is interesting.', '2004-01-06 16:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(533629, 53760, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lively studio shot. I like the vivid background, the mid-air pose of the model, the flowers and the colour balance between foreground items (dress, tights, skin, hair) and background. I think lighting could be better - more even coverage on the background and a touch less shadow on her face.</td>', 'A lively studio shot. I like the vivid background, the mid-air pose of the model, the flowers and the colour balance between foreground items (dress, tights, skin, hair) and background. I think lighting could be better - more even coverage on the background and a touch less shadow on her face.', '2004-01-06 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(533630, 53836, 4008, '<td valign="top">This idea is now recurring every challenge and it is loosing its appeal to me. I can see yours is slightly different, with suggested movement of both the club and the ball and the yellow piece suspended, so good job, but still....too often.</td>', 'This idea is now recurring every challenge and it is loosing its appeal to me. I can see yours is slightly different, with suggested movement of both the club and the ball and the yellow piece suspended, so good job, but still....too often.', '2004-01-06 16:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(533632, 53666, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh I like the way the colour and lighting of the foreground and the building behind contrast with each other. This is quite intriguing!</td>', 'Oooh I like the way the colour and lighting of the foreground and the building behind contrast with each other. This is quite intriguing!', '2004-01-06 17:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(533636, 53499, 3087, '<td valign="top">One reason this shot works so well is the superb capture of expressions. I also like the "shape" of the group players taken as a whole. The two raised players are so well captured mid-motion that there is a real element of wanting to look closely to understand what is happening. Well cropped to provide enough backrgound and to create a good composition. I really like this. And I don''t even like sport!!!</td>', 'One reason this shot works so well is the superb capture of expressions. I also like the "shape" of the group players taken as a whole. The two raised players are so well captured mid-motion that there is a real element of wanting to look closely to understand what is happening. Well cropped to provide enough backrgound and to create a good composition. I really like this. And I don''t even like sport!!!', '2004-01-06 17:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(533644, 53825, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - is this an actual explosion/ breaking or a very carefully set up studio shot? I''m not suggesting one is "better" or preferable to the other - the end result is what counts to me - but I am curious!</td>', 'Very nicely done - is this an actual explosion/ breaking or a very carefully set up studio shot? I''m not suggesting one is "better" or preferable to the other - the end result is what counts to me - but I am curious!', '2004-01-06 17:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(533648, 53734, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb, I think this is my favourite in this challenge! It''s reminiscent (to me) of Audrey Hepburn and more recently of Audrey Tautou in Amelie. So altogether a bit of an Audrey moment for me! Composition is just so beautiful - the exact angle of her face, the position of her ear next to the corner of the frame (and how far in from that it is), the way her hair almost disappears into the background making an intriguing abstract shape of her face, the way the water angles to the opposite corner...). You''ve also succeeded in capturing a wonderful expression of fun in your model''s features as she squirts away! Just beautiful!</td>', 'Absolutely superb, I think this is my favourite in this challenge! It''s reminiscent (to me) of Audrey Hepburn and more recently of Audrey Tautou in Amelie. So altogether a bit of an Audrey moment for me! Composition is just so beautiful - the exact angle of her face, the position of her ear next to the corner of the frame (and how far in from that it is), the way her hair almost disappears into the background making an intriguing abstract shape of her face, the way the water angles to the opposite corner...). You''ve also succeeded in capturing a wonderful expression of fun in your model''s features as she squirts away! Just beautiful!', '2004-01-06 17:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(533651, 53642, 3087, '<td valign="top">No distracting elements in the background, nice composition, nice angle, good determined expression on skier. But somehow lacks punch for me. Sorry!</td>', 'No distracting elements in the background, nice composition, nice angle, good determined expression on skier. But somehow lacks punch for me. Sorry!', '2004-01-06 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(533652, 53836, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cool - and the colours are zingy - has a surreal abstract feel to it.</td>', 'Cool - and the colours are zingy - has a surreal abstract feel to it.', '2004-01-06 17:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(533654, 52646, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very "romantic" (in the platonic not sexual way) and the framing of the trees is beautiful.</td>', 'Very "romantic" (in the platonic not sexual way) and the framing of the trees is beautiful.', '2004-01-06 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(533657, 53471, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the low viewpoint and the inclusion of those rocks just below the surface makes the foreground really intriguing. Given the bland white colour of the sky I''d consider cropping more tightly at the top to exclude it but I may be in a minority as many can''t appreciate landscapes without sky in them.</td>', 'I like the low viewpoint and the inclusion of those rocks just below the surface makes the foreground really intriguing. Given the bland white colour of the sky I''d consider cropping more tightly at the top to exclude it but I may be in a minority as many can''t appreciate landscapes without sky in them.', '2004-01-06 17:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(533659, 53689, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way the posts frame the seats and chains.</td>', 'I like the way the posts frame the seats and chains.', '2004-01-06 17:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(533664, 53831, 3087, '<td valign="top">Overall image much too dark for my tastes but I like the converging lines and the romantic nature of the content.</td>', 'Overall image much too dark for my tastes but I like the converging lines and the romantic nature of the content.', '2004-01-06 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(533667, 53363, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition (position within frame, angle of arm and of mike stand, tilt of head, crop).<br/>I don''t always like borders that don''t border the entire image but it enhances rather than detracts in this case. Motion being limited to only his arm and a little on his head works well.</td>', 'Excellent composition (position within frame, angle of arm and of mike stand, tilt of head, crop).I don''t always like borders that don''t border the entire image but it enhances rather than detracts in this case. Motion being limited to only his arm and a little on his head works well.', '2004-01-06 17:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(533668, 53821, 3087, '<td valign="top">He he! Nicely done and the lines between tarmac, shrub-dotted earth and cloudy sky add interest too!</td>', 'He he! Nicely done and the lines between tarmac, shrub-dotted earth and cloudy sky add interest too!', '2004-01-06 17:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(533673, 53225, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very cool - I like the way the motion of the ball is balanced by the still pine needles. A nice seasonal study.</td>', 'This is very cool - I like the way the motion of the ball is balanced by the still pine needles. A nice seasonal study.', '2004-01-06 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(533677, 53692, 15381, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure, but this really looks photoshopped...i really would have voted it higher if it wasn''t...it would''ve looke more natural</td>', 'I''m not sure, but this really looks photoshopped...i really would have voted it higher if it wasn''t...it would''ve looke more natural', '2004-01-06 17:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
