(533918, 53767, 6597, '<td valign="top">good composition 8</td>', 'good composition 8', '2004-01-06 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(533921, 52646, 6597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful winter scene 8</td>', 'Beautiful winter scene 8', '2004-01-06 23:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(533926, 53643, 6597, '<td valign="top">Easy to see the action here I like the background texture 7</td>', 'Easy to see the action here I like the background texture 7', '2004-01-06 23:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(533956, 53359, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good action shot, and from browsing through the other shots, one of the best I''ve seen.  I like the slow shutter speed and the color is good.  I only wish the surroundings were more black.  Overall great shot though. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think this is a good action shot, and from browsing through the other shots, one of the best I''ve seen.  I like the slow shutter speed and the color is good.  I only wish the surroundings were more black.  Overall great shot though. ~Heather~', '2004-01-06 23:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(534343, 53753, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great shot, especially with the one open mouth in the middle and all those others spiralling around it. great colors as well. 10</td>', 'Great shot, especially with the one open mouth in the middle and all those others spiralling around it. great colors as well. 10', '2004-01-07 06:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(534356, 53142, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this - a refreshingly different view of fireworks. I do really think it would have been better in a portrait format: as it is, the central composition weakens the impact of the image: the large amount of negative space (whilst helpful in isolating the spark lines) doesn''t add THAT much. 8</td>', 'I like this - a refreshingly different view of fireworks. I do really think it would have been better in a portrait format: as it is, the central composition weakens the impact of the image: the large amount of negative space (whilst helpful in isolating the spark lines) doesn''t add THAT much. 8', '2004-01-07 07:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(534358, 53694, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - I''d guess that this is quite early in the game, from the cleanliness of those white shorts, but it has a real feel of the driven-into-the-ground exhaustion of the end of a game, when things almost grind to a halt like boxers who''ve beaten each other to a standstill. If only it weren''t for the guy half hidden behind the no. 17 it''d be a great shot.</td>', 'Good work - I''d guess that this is quite early in the game, from the cleanliness of those white shorts, but it has a real feel of the driven-into-the-ground exhaustion of the end of a game, when things almost grind to a halt like boxers who''ve beaten each other to a standstill. If only it weren''t for the guy half hidden behind the no. 17 it''d be a great shot.', '2004-01-07 07:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(534360, 53499, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great moment - and with a little mystery too (where the hell are the hoops'' three-quarters?) - and a great study in effort. 9</td>', 'Great shot, great moment - and with a little mystery too (where the hell are the hoops'' three-quarters?) - and a great study in effort. 9', '2004-01-07 07:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(534364, 52646, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent, strong composition. Love the placing of the figures - dad striding ahead with the sled, daughter trailing behind. It isn''t really an action shot though, is it? Sure there''s some action, but that''s hardly the subject of the image, and I bet you get penalised for that. You get an 8 from me though.</td>', 'Excellent, strong composition. Love the placing of the figures - dad striding ahead with the sled, daughter trailing behind. It isn''t really an action shot though, is it? Sure there''s some action, but that''s hardly the subject of the image, and I bet you get penalised for that. You get an 8 from me though.', '2004-01-07 07:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(534369, 53737, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice crop. A tiny bit grainy, but not too much. The horizon seems a bit bended like you were using a wide angle lens, but it''s not bothering me too much. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice crop. A tiny bit grainy, but not too much. The horizon seems a bit bended like you were using a wide angle lens, but it''s not bothering me too much. Nice job.', '2004-01-07 07:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(534371, 53834, 7543, '<td valign="top">Way too much digital processing. I don''t like the halo around the kid, and the oversharpening white line along the outlines is distracting. Looks fake, I think this would have been a better shot without the PS work, or at least most of it, the original seems to have been a nice shot.</td>', 'Way too much digital processing. I don''t like the halo around the kid, and the oversharpening white line along the outlines is distracting. Looks fake, I think this would have been a better shot without the PS work, or at least most of it, the original seems to have been a nice shot.', '2004-01-07 07:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(534374, 53499, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!! This could be the winner. Nice misty look, yet the players are cristal clear. Good shutter speed and a great moment. My favorite yet. (update: my only 10)</td>', 'Great shot!!! This could be the winner. Nice misty look, yet the players are cristal clear. Good shutter speed and a great moment. My favorite yet. (update: my only 10)', '2004-01-07 07:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(534375, 53734, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very nice indeed 9</td>', 'Very nice, very nice indeed 9', '2004-01-07 07:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(534376, 53665, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice. The crop is good, and I like the colors, neutral colors. The flame sticks out quite nicely in the corner. I could not have done this better, I hope other people like it too.</td>', 'Nice, very nice. The crop is good, and I like the colors, neutral colors. The flame sticks out quite nicely in the corner. I could not have done this better, I hope other people like it too.', '2004-01-07 07:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(534464, 52646, 15642, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. One question: Is there any way to separate the two figures better?</td>', 'Gorgeous. One question: Is there any way to separate the two figures better?', '2004-01-07 09:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(534467, 52842, 15642, '<td valign="top">I hate it when cops arrest children. Seriously, nice "news-like" shot.</td>', 'I hate it when cops arrest children. Seriously, nice "news-like" shot.', '2004-01-07 09:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(534469, 53689, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice framing</td>', 'Nice framing', '2004-01-07 09:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
