(534835, 53836, 7350, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, great portrayal of Action.  I think the only thing to improve this would be to make it a little more realistic - at least don''t show the point of the tee.  Cutting the tee off at the bottom would make it look like at least it could be set up somewhere.  Still, a 10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent shot, great portrayal of Action.  I think the only thing to improve this would be to make it a little more realistic - at least don''t show the point of the tee.  Cutting the tee off at the bottom would make it look like at least it could be set up somewhere.  Still, a 10 from me.', '2004-01-07 12:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(534838, 53666, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the drama of this shot.  Nice work.  10.</td>', 'I love the drama of this shot.  Nice work.  10.', '2004-01-07 12:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
