(535004, 53725, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful freeze of the action, with perfect exposure and focus - not easy with a moving subject. I really like the movement and color in the water.</td>', 'Beautiful freeze of the action, with perfect exposure and focus - not easy with a moving subject. I really like the movement and color in the water.', '2004-01-07 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(535005, 53752, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture; the gulls seem to be flying in formation to make your composition.</td>', 'Great capture; the gulls seem to be flying in formation to make your composition.', '2004-01-07 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(535008, 53767, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the sunset and the overall composition, but I wish the boat were more prominent.</td>', 'I like the sunset and the overall composition, but I wish the boat were more prominent.', '2004-01-07 14:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(535010, 53219, 12733, '<td valign="top">The dog certainly looks happy. The crop seems too tight on his eye; a little of his head above the eye would have madfe this perfect.</td>', 'The dog certainly looks happy. The crop seems too tight on his eye; a little of his head above the eye would have madfe this perfect.', '2004-01-07 14:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(535017, 53841, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think it would have been a stronger photo in a completely dark room, or a room so dimly lit that the human figure was an almost invisible shadow. The background lights are distracting, IMHO.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think it would have been a stronger photo in a completely dark room, or a room so dimly lit that the human figure was an almost invisible shadow. The background lights are distracting, IMHO.', '2004-01-07 14:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(535019, 53831, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice composition. The rider is clearly the main element, but the picture makes a nice scenic.</td>', 'A nice composition. The rider is clearly the main element, but the picture makes a nice scenic.', '2004-01-07 14:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(535027, 53692, 12733, '<td valign="top">The blur is interesting; how do you do it while keeping the main figure sharp?  I''m guessing auxiliary flash during part of a longer exposure, but I don''t really know that''s the case.</td>', 'The blur is interesting; how do you do it while keeping the main figure sharp?  I''m guessing auxiliary flash during part of a longer exposure, but I don''t really know that''s the case.', '2004-01-07 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(535032, 53666, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sweeping lights give an exciting effect that would be wonderful in a challenge that emphasized lights or night scenes. In this case, I think the Bomber itself needs to be more visible than just a streak of light.</td>', 'The sweeping lights give an exciting effect that would be wonderful in a challenge that emphasized lights or night scenes. In this case, I think the Bomber itself needs to be more visible than just a streak of light.', '2004-01-07 14:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(535036, 53499, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture of the action. I think the background elements - the fog and out of focus spectators - detract a lot from the overall effect.</td>', 'Fantastic capture of the action. I think the background elements - the fog and out of focus spectators - detract a lot from the overall effect.', '2004-01-07 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(535038, 53441, 12733, '<td valign="top">Are those smiles or grimaces of pain or anger? The good exposure and capture of the falling hat get lost beside those snarling mouths.</td>', 'Are those smiles or grimaces of pain or anger? The good exposure and capture of the falling hat get lost beside those snarling mouths.', '2004-01-07 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(535040, 53428, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the flying snow; good colors and contrast of the white snow with the tones of the man''s skin, cloting and sled.</td>', 'Great texture on the flying snow; good colors and contrast of the white snow with the tones of the man''s skin, cloting and sled.', '2004-01-07 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(535042, 53653, 12733, '<td valign="top">The fire is spectacular, and the figures certainly show action.</td>', 'The fire is spectacular, and the figures certainly show action.', '2004-01-07 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(535045, 53724, 12733, '<td valign="top">With enough legs, you can swim many strokes at once. Beautiful capture, nice coloors, sharp photo.</td>', 'With enough legs, you can swim many strokes at once. Beautiful capture, nice coloors, sharp photo.', '2004-01-07 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(535047, 52925, 12733, '<td valign="top">Almost a great pattern shot. The birds look a little blurry, and the object sticking up on the left breaks up the illusion of great height.</td>', 'Almost a great pattern shot. The birds look a little blurry, and the object sticking up on the left breaks up the illusion of great height.', '2004-01-07 14:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(535051, 53838, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the contrast of one top down and two spinning. The choice of colors highlights the differences. Very nice.</td>', 'I like the colors and the contrast of one top down and two spinning. The choice of colors highlights the differences. Very nice.', '2004-01-07 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(535054, 53642, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze (no pun intended) of the motion. Panning with the skier to blur the trees a little would have emphasezed the sense of "flying."</td>', 'Nice freeze (no pun intended) of the motion. Panning with the skier to blur the trees a little would have emphasezed the sense of "flying."', '2004-01-07 14:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(535056, 53665, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fire and ice, a nice contrast. An interesting composition that directs the eye around the photo.</td>', 'Fire and ice, a nice contrast. An interesting composition that directs the eye around the photo.', '2004-01-07 14:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(535057, 53225, 12733, '<td valign="top">Action?</td>', 'Action?', '2004-01-07 14:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(535060, 53833, 12733, '<td valign="top">Seems like a good try at high key, but IMHO it comes off looking washed out.</td>', 'Seems like a good try at high key, but IMHO it comes off looking washed out.', '2004-01-07 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(535062, 53359, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the theme, and great timinmg on the falling dominoes. I like the slow shutter for blur.</td>', 'An interesting take on the theme, and great timinmg on the falling dominoes. I like the slow shutter for blur.', '2004-01-07 14:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(535065, 53193, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sunlight on the rocks, the froth of the water, the droplets off the fisherman''s body all create a very nice effect. Is that a rainbow in the net, or are nets that color?</td>', 'The sunlight on the rocks, the froth of the water, the droplets off the fisherman''s body all create a very nice effect. Is that a rainbow in the net, or are nets that color?', '2004-01-07 14:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(535068, 53760, 12733, '<td valign="top">The photographic equivalent of juggling - get the woman and all the flowers in the frame before they fall. Nice lighting, sharp focus and good exposure.</td>', 'The photographic equivalent of juggling - get the woman and all the flowers in the frame before they fall. Nice lighting, sharp focus and good exposure.', '2004-01-07 14:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(535069, 53719, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nicely composed and timed just right. A textbook action shot.</td>', 'Great shot, nicely composed and timed just right. A textbook action shot.', '2004-01-07 14:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(535070, 53661, 12733, '<td valign="top">Blur contributes a lot to the sense of motion, but IMHO you need to see the subjcet clearly enough to identify it without relying on the title.</td>', 'Blur contributes a lot to the sense of motion, but IMHO you need to see the subjcet clearly enough to identify it without relying on the title.', '2004-01-07 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(535072, 53836, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur to create the effect of motion. I''m guessing that all elements are resting on the ground, with the camera directly above.</td>', 'Nice use of blur to create the effect of motion. I''m guessing that all elements are resting on the ground, with the camera directly above.', '2004-01-07 14:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(535074, 53777, 12733, '<td valign="top">Almost the moment of truth. Perfect timing, great exposure, and thank the establishment for keeping their lanes so well polished to hold the great reflections.</td>', 'Almost the moment of truth. Perfect timing, great exposure, and thank the establishment for keeping their lanes so well polished to hold the great reflections.', '2004-01-07 14:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(535075, 53748, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur to show the motion without overdoing it.</td>', 'Nice use of blur to show the motion without overdoing it.', '2004-01-07 14:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(535076, 53727, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Getting them on the curve helps bring the horses into full-face while allowing a side view of the cart and riders. This looks like a racing event, but not one I''m familiar with.</td>', 'Nice catch. Getting them on the curve helps bring the horses into full-face while allowing a side view of the cart and riders. This looks like a racing event, but not one I''m familiar with.', '2004-01-07 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(535077, 53644, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and reflections on the water. I''d like to have seen you come in tighter on the boat, which would also move the horizon off center.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and reflections on the water. I''d like to have seen you come in tighter on the boat, which would also move the horizon off center.', '2004-01-07 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(535082, 53325, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Pity the eagle''s head isn''t in sharper focus.</td>', 'Nice composition. Pity the eagle''s head isn''t in sharper focus.', '2004-01-07 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(535083, 53705, 12733, '<td valign="top">The white water is certainly spectacular. The action is good, and it''s amazing you could get the kayaker that sharp.</td>', 'The white water is certainly spectacular. The action is good, and it''s amazing you could get the kayaker that sharp.', '2004-01-07 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
