(536018, 53439, 4007, '<td valign="top">The image quality is rather low here.  I"m not sure if this has been over-processed in a neat-image type program or if it has been cropped too much or some other problem has come up, but there really is hardly any detail available here at all, and it is a problem.</td>', 'The image quality is rather low here.  I"m not sure if this has been over-processed in a neat-image type program or if it has been cropped too much or some other problem has come up, but there really is hardly any detail available here at all, and it is a problem.', '2004-01-08 07:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(536019, 53219, 4007, '<td valign="top">Maybe not always, but if you need a title that trys to convince your audience that your shot fits the challenge, it probably doesn''t fit the challenge.  I think this shot is pushing the criteria of an action shot.  That aside, my natural reaction to this shot meant to represent happiness is mild disgust.  The dog might be enjoying that bone greatly, but it just looks a little bit nasty to me.</td>', 'Maybe not always, but if you need a title that trys to convince your audience that your shot fits the challenge, it probably doesn''t fit the challenge.  I think this shot is pushing the criteria of an action shot.  That aside, my natural reaction to this shot meant to represent happiness is mild disgust.  The dog might be enjoying that bone greatly, but it just looks a little bit nasty to me.', '2004-01-08 08:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(536020, 53826, 4007, '<td valign="top">The subject itself is interesting but he''s mostly centered in the shot and everything that surrounds him is pretty dull.  I''d say get in closer and make him fill up as much of the frame as you can manage to avoid including so much of the uninteresting background.  And if you''ve got enough resolution to play with, I''d consider cropping it closer as well.</td>', 'The subject itself is interesting but he''s mostly centered in the shot and everything that surrounds him is pretty dull.  I''d say get in closer and make him fill up as much of the frame as you can manage to avoid including so much of the uninteresting background.  And if you''ve got enough resolution to play with, I''d consider cropping it closer as well.', '2004-01-08 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(536022, 53834, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the photoshopped motion blur.  I''d recommend sticking to the camera for effects.  This ends up looking cheesy and discrediting the shot as a valid photographic effort.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the photoshopped motion blur.  I''d recommend sticking to the camera for effects.  This ends up looking cheesy and discrediting the shot as a valid photographic effort.', '2004-01-08 08:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(536025, 53363, 4007, '<td valign="top">The PS motion blur works pretty well here, but I''m not a big fan of using fake motion blurs in general.  It still has the effect of discrediting this as a photographic achievement and giving it an artificial feel.  Private message me if I''m wrong and this was done in camera, and I''ll be sure to reconsider the shot.</td>', 'The PS motion blur works pretty well here, but I''m not a big fan of using fake motion blurs in general.  It still has the effect of discrediting this as a photographic achievement and giving it an artificial feel.  Private message me if I''m wrong and this was done in camera, and I''ll be sure to reconsider the shot.', '2004-01-08 08:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(536072, 53760, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice flashy background color. The model is not bad too :)<br/>The movement seems not real to me. Is she really jumping?</td>', 'Nice flashy background color. The model is not bad too :)The movement seems not real to me. Is she really jumping?', '2004-01-08 09:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(536073, 53653, 8139, '<td valign="top">impressive.</td>', 'impressive.', '2004-01-08 09:35:32.000000', NULL, 1);
