(536759, 53672, 9411, '<td valign="top">I think I know what this is. Ice skater? It''s an interesting abstract image with nice colours, but I''m afraid it''s just too abstract to reall work as an action shot. 4</td>', 'I think I know what this is. Ice skater? It''s an interesting abstract image with nice colours, but I''m afraid it''s just too abstract to reall work as an action shot. 4', '2004-01-08 18:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
