(536905, 53644, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a nice serene scene, although I do see the slight ripples of the water behind the boat so there is some action too. The sunset is jsut enough to add a nice color and set the atmosphere. The only suggestion would be to crop a little off the water so the horizon line isnt directly in the middle, which would put more emphasis on the boat as well.</td>', 'This is a nice serene scene, although I do see the slight ripples of the water behind the boat so there is some action too. The sunset is jsut enough to add a nice color and set the atmosphere. The only suggestion would be to crop a little off the water so the horizon line isnt directly in the middle, which would put more emphasis on the boat as well.', '2004-01-08 22:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
