(536919, 53692, 11078, '<td valign="top">This is a great action shot<br/>But it looks like it is super imposed<br/>Its so sharp and in focus<br/>Great work</td>', 'This is a great action shotBut it looks like it is super imposedIts so sharp and in focusGreat work', '2004-01-08 22:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(536922, 53537, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is certainly action but there are a few things that bother me about it. The water aspect is good, and with these type of shots I know that you can hardly control them so these are just some suggestions about what could have been ''better''. The frame crops out the front of the board which gives it a disjoiinted feel, and also slightly unbalanced with the space on the right. The surfer looks odd, it doesnt look like it''s a silhouette but you cant see his face and he just looks like a black form of a man, very unusual.</td>', 'This is certainly action but there are a few things that bother me about it. The water aspect is good, and with these type of shots I know that you can hardly control them so these are just some suggestions about what could have been ''better''. The frame crops out the front of the board which gives it a disjoiinted feel, and also slightly unbalanced with the space on the right. The surfer looks odd, it doesnt look like it''s a silhouette but you cant see his face and he just looks like a black form of a man, very unusual.', '2004-01-08 22:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(536923, 53660, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great shot! A little soft in places, but the head is very clear, and the wings show motion. Ideally it would have been better with a little more room above the wings, but I know how that''s not always possible as they zoom around. Could possibly do with some levels play as it seems a little dark, but not overly so.</td>', 'Great shot! A little soft in places, but the head is very clear, and the wings show motion. Ideally it would have been better with a little more room above the wings, but I know how that''s not always possible as they zoom around. Could possibly do with some levels play as it seems a little dark, but not overly so.', '2004-01-08 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(536924, 53656, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice action <br/>Its a shame its not cropped closer and a bit more detail in the birds although having said that it would not be very easy to do <br/></td>', 'Nice action Its a shame its not cropped closer and a bit more detail in the birds although having said that it would not be very easy to do ', '2004-01-08 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
