(536931, 53787, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice action But I dont like the sepia tone <br/>The sea is a lovely colour and I think the natural colour would give the image more life. as it is it looks more like a ploughed field with a wave.<br/>Although having said that probably the next comment you get will say it looks great in Sepia  Great image though</td>', 'Nice action But I dont like the sepia tone The sea is a lovely colour and I think the natural colour would give the image more life. as it is it looks more like a ploughed field with a wave.Although having said that probably the next comment you get will say it looks great in Sepia  Great image though', '2004-01-08 22:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
