(537722, 53692, 10084, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling of motion here. Very dynamic and graphic. The background seems to move around the guy.</td>', 'I get the feeling of motion here. Very dynamic and graphic. The background seems to move around the guy.', '2004-01-09 22:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(537723, 53643, 10084, '<td valign="top">Background really shows speed. The contrast of the subject really pops out of the background. The dark clothes really helps. The blur in the wheels and feet really give that extra touch of speed.</td>', 'Background really shows speed. The contrast of the subject really pops out of the background. The dark clothes really helps. The blur in the wheels and feet really give that extra touch of speed.', '2004-01-09 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(537755, 53756, 14193, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture is so surprisingly beautiful. So clear on the subject, but a nicely unfocused background. (9)</td>', 'Wow, this picture is so surprisingly beautiful. So clear on the subject, but a nicely unfocused background. (9)', '2004-01-10 00:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(537757, 53643, 14193, '<td valign="top">Very well executed. Great job. (8)</td>', 'Very well executed. Great job. (8)', '2004-01-10 00:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(537758, 53767, 14193, '<td valign="top">I want to move to Florida!!!, Very beautiful shot. (9)</td>', 'I want to move to Florida!!!, Very beautiful shot. (9)', '2004-01-10 00:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(537826, 53749, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like the colour play very much. The angle of view and cropping could be improved though. Still, a 9 from me.</td>', 'Like the colour play very much. The angle of view and cropping could be improved though. Still, a 9 from me.', '2004-01-10 04:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(537828, 52844, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Like the composition and how you manged to get the exposure fairly well on the non-moving and moving parts. Was probably hard to achiev. The lines coming from the reflections are just great. How many balls made it into a pocket?<br/>A 9 from me</td>', 'Great shot! Like the composition and how you manged to get the exposure fairly well on the non-moving and moving parts. Was probably hard to achiev. The lines coming from the reflections are just great. How many balls made it into a pocket?A 9 from me', '2004-01-10 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(537829, 53778, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great stop motion with well used DOF. The exposure is a little on the dark site for the dog, however, that''s not an issue of your camerawork, it''s just due to the though light situation.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great stop motion with well used DOF. The exposure is a little on the dark site for the dog, however, that''s not an issue of your camerawork, it''s just due to the though light situation.  Good luck.', '2004-01-10 04:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(537830, 53748, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great concept and very well arranged. Like the colours of the wall and the clothes of the girl. Also that only her right leg is in motion. Was it hard for her to achiev that? Good luck.</td>', 'Great concept and very well arranged. Like the colours of the wall and the clothes of the girl. Also that only her right leg is in motion. Was it hard for her to achiev that? Good luck.', '2004-01-10 04:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(537831, 53751, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the spinning motion very much: not to strong so one gets where one is looking at. Also like how you set the light: the overexposed right edge with its blue tint is looking great. don''t know if a portion of the globe with some ocean might have been better though. Good luck! 8</td>', 'I like the spinning motion very much: not to strong so one gets where one is looking at. Also like how you set the light: the overexposed right edge with its blue tint is looking great. don''t know if a portion of the globe with some ocean might have been better though. Good luck! 8', '2004-01-10 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(537833, 53719, 5158, '<td valign="top">Being a hobby pilot myself I have to say that this looks realy like a textbook landing, allthough the front wheel could be a little higher. Like how you combined great sharpnes with just a bit of motion in the propeller. A narrower DOF blurring the background would have been great, but technically for sure not achievable directly from the camera. Great submission and a 9 from me.</td>', 'Being a hobby pilot myself I have to say that this looks realy like a textbook landing, allthough the front wheel could be a little higher. Like how you combined great sharpnes with just a bit of motion in the propeller. A narrower DOF blurring the background would have been great, but technically for sure not achievable directly from the camera. Great submission and a 9 from me.', '2004-01-10 04:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(537844, 53039, 9116, '<td valign="top">My father was a top pigeon "sportsman" and a reporter for a regional pigeon paper. Now that I''m 45, this is the sharpest "in flight" pigeon picture I have ever seen.  Compliments.</td>', 'My father was a top pigeon "sportsman" and a reporter for a regional pigeon paper. Now that I''m 45, this is the sharpest "in flight" pigeon picture I have ever seen.  Compliments.', '2004-01-10 05:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(537907, 53689, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wo!  This rocks.  I love the framing from the posts and the movement of the swing adds a nice touch.  Vey well done.  10  Jacko.</td>', 'Wo!  This rocks.  I love the framing from the posts and the movement of the swing adds a nice touch.  Vey well done.  10  Jacko.', '2004-01-10 09:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(537909, 53753, 2716, '<td valign="top">dayum!  What a dynamic photo.  Love the sharpness of the moouth near the middle and motion blur of the rest.  Congrats.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'dayum!  What a dynamic photo.  Love the sharpness of the moouth near the middle and motion blur of the rest.  Congrats.  Jacko.  10', '2004-01-10 09:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(537911, 52842, 2716, '<td valign="top">Imma give this a 10, just for the feel of it.  Very industrial.  Love it.  Jako.  10</td>', 'Imma give this a 10, just for the feel of it.  Very industrial.  Love it.  Jako.  10', '2004-01-10 09:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(537912, 53445, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love those shots; makes me think of something I''d see in National Geographic.  Nic capture.  Jacko 9</td>', 'Love those shots; makes me think of something I''d see in National Geographic.  Nic capture.  Jacko 9', '2004-01-10 09:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(537913, 53665, 2716, '<td valign="top">I don''t why I like this so much.  I guess I just like the absurdity of it all.  "Don''t doooo it maaaannnn!"  NIce touch with a splash of clolor in the bottom right.  NOt sure if it was planned, but the dock acts as an excellent leading line to the axman.  Very very effective composition.     Jacko.  Well dserved 10.</td>', 'I don''t why I like this so much.  I guess I just like the absurdity of it all.  "Don''t doooo it maaaannnn!"  NIce touch with a splash of clolor in the bottom right.  NOt sure if it was planned, but the dock acts as an excellent leading line to the axman.  Very very effective composition.     Jacko.  Well dserved 10.', '2004-01-10 09:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(537914, 53816, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a cute shot.  Love it.  The colors work well together, and I love the strong horizontal lines.  The addition of the plant in front is a nice touch.  Jacko.  10  Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Wow!  What a cute shot.  Love it.  The colors work well together, and I love the strong horizontal lines.  The addition of the plant in front is a nice touch.  Jacko.  10  Congrats on a great shot.', '2004-01-10 09:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(537928, 53442, 12611, '<td valign="top">THats me in the red truck! I like the composition  within the mirror, the mountain is nice, and the feeling of movement outrside is nice. I would crop the mirror to be more in th emiddle and not hanging out the edge of the picture frame.</td>', 'THats me in the red truck! I like the composition  within the mirror, the mountain is nice, and the feeling of movement outrside is nice. I would crop the mirror to be more in th emiddle and not hanging out the edge of the picture frame.', '2004-01-10 09:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(537930, 53454, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here. Is it "mon" though? who knows. matbe something else in the frame would help to convey action a bit more.</td>', 'I like the colors here. Is it "mon" though? who knows. matbe something else in the frame would help to convey action a bit more.', '2004-01-10 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(537931, 53656, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think this is great, maybe a bit over sharpened and too contrasty for instance, around the wings. I like the tree and the color similarity.</td>', 'I think this is great, maybe a bit over sharpened and too contrasty for instance, around the wings. I like the tree and the color similarity.', '2004-01-10 09:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(537933, 53325, 12611, '<td valign="top">THats an eagle shot for you.I think th eshot is a nice catch but overall it is not too aesthetically pleasing. Crop that bird into a golden mean position and use a lot less tree branch, IMHO.</td>', 'THats an eagle shot for you.I think th eshot is a nice catch but overall it is not too aesthetically pleasing. Crop that bird into a golden mean position and use a lot less tree branch, IMHO.', '2004-01-10 09:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(537936, 53428, 12611, '<td valign="top">If that was a toboggan or some wood type sled you would have something really great here. and widen the crop a bit. Nice clarity and earthtones. Your focus came out nice too.</td>', 'If that was a toboggan or some wood type sled you would have something really great here. and widen the crop a bit. Nice clarity and earthtones. Your focus came out nice too.', '2004-01-10 09:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(537937, 53760, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautful portrait overall. I absolutely dig that yellow. The expression is perfect. the only minor comment would be to somehow make sure that the right arm, which is a focal point of the shot,is sharper or more focused. But that is nitpicking. great shot.</td>', 'Beautful portrait overall. I absolutely dig that yellow. The expression is perfect. the only minor comment would be to somehow make sure that the right arm, which is a focal point of the shot,is sharper or more focused. But that is nitpicking. great shot.', '2004-01-10 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(537938, 53705, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome and I love the oar. the watercolors could be a bit better- or more vivid.</td>', 'Awesome and I love the oar. the watercolors could be a bit better- or more vivid.', '2004-01-10 09:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(537939, 53834, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in the shadows, Nice shot. Save those great borders for tryptics and flower shots!</td>', 'I like the colors in the shadows, Nice shot. Save those great borders for tryptics and flower shots!', '2004-01-10 09:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(537940, 53672, 12611, '<td valign="top">Now this is th etype abstract shot that makes me love this website. Nice job. Maybe the crop is too tall, but the composition, light and color are superb.</td>', 'Now this is th etype abstract shot that makes me love this website. Nice job. Maybe the crop is too tall, but the composition, light and color are superb.', '2004-01-10 09:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(537941, 53768, 12611, '<td valign="top">A wonderful demonstration of when a person is too old and out of shape to server normally, adn has to  alter his serve to compensate. I like the composition and feeling of motion.</td>', 'A wonderful demonstration of when a person is too old and out of shape to server normally, adn has to  alter his serve to compensate. I like the composition and feeling of motion.', '2004-01-10 09:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(537963, 52844, 12569, '<td valign="top">wow!!!!!</td>', 'wow!!!!!', '2004-01-10 10:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(538065, 53734, 11793, '<td valign="top">good capture - nice stop action<br/>good title<br/> <br/>skin is a bit blotchy</td>', 'good capture - nice stop actiongood title skin is a bit blotchy', '2004-01-10 13:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(538107, 53304, 4517, '<td valign="top">seagle?</td>', 'seagle?', '2004-01-10 13:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(538113, 53787, 7889, '<td valign="top">The expanse of water at the top adds great impact to the photo. good effort. You get my top vote</td>', 'The expanse of water at the top adds great impact to the photo. good effort. You get my top vote', '2004-01-10 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(538114, 53742, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great shot , the expressions on the faces are wondeful. well done</td>', 'Great shot , the expressions on the faces are wondeful. well done', '2004-01-10 13:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(538155, 53666, 15966, '<td valign="top">it looks like a huge fan... don''t stick your fingers in!</td>', 'it looks like a huge fan... don''t stick your fingers in!', '2004-01-10 15:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(538195, 53689, 15970, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo! I love how the poles frame the sides! Good Job!</td>', 'Very well taken photo! I love how the poles frame the sides! Good Job!', '2004-01-10 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(538196, 53653, 15970, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT!  I wish i could give this one to my boyfriend (he''s a fire fighter)  Looks Awesome!</td>', 'GREAT SHOT!  I wish i could give this one to my boyfriend (he''s a fire fighter)  Looks Awesome!', '2004-01-10 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(538197, 53677, 15970, '<td valign="top">These people are CRAZY!!</td>', 'These people are CRAZY!!', '2004-01-10 16:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(538220, 53840, 15968, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.</td>', 'excellent shot.', '2004-01-10 17:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(538223, 53661, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the effect, did you use a filer? Although I would love to see a sharp point in focus where my eyes could have a rest. This way I have the feeling that the effect overrides the photo itself.</td>', 'I like the effect, did you use a filer? Although I would love to see a sharp point in focus where my eyes could have a rest. This way I have the feeling that the effect overrides the photo itself.', '2004-01-10 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(538229, 53767, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, thought it''s too calm for my personal taste to be action.</td>', 'Nice sunset, thought it''s too calm for my personal taste to be action.', '2004-01-10 17:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(538359, 53734, 3102, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favorite of the challenge -- very, very well executed!  The water shows up perfectly against the black background, and the skin tones are great.  The only little nitpick I have is that her hair blends into the background a little too much, but it''s not enough to keep me from making this a 10!  Let me be the first to congratulate you on the ribbon!  :)</td>', 'Definitely my favorite of the challenge -- very, very well executed!  The water shows up perfectly against the black background, and the skin tones are great.  The only little nitpick I have is that her hair blends into the background a little too much, but it''s not enough to keep me from making this a 10!  Let me be the first to congratulate you on the ribbon!  :)', '2004-01-10 20:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(538361, 53760, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of my two 10s for the challenge -- this is just super!  Simple, yet full of fun, energy and color.  Way to go!  I can''t imagine this not earning a ribbon.</td>', 'One of my two 10s for the challenge -- this is just super!  Simple, yet full of fun, energy and color.  Way to go!  I can''t imagine this not earning a ribbon.', '2004-01-10 20:25:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(538363, 52844, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I''m betting it took quite a few shots to pull this one off just right.  Very impressive!</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I''m betting it took quite a few shots to pull this one off just right.  Very impressive!', '2004-01-10 20:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(538364, 53677, 3102, '<td valign="top">Bah -- the heck with that!  We have a group here in Pittsburgh that does this every New Year''s also.  I have trouble jumping into a pool in the middle of summer!  Then again, any time you can see babes in bikinis in the middle of winter, it can''t be all that bad!  Nice shot -- I''m going to grab another blanket now... :)</td>', 'Bah -- the heck with that!  We have a group here in Pittsburgh that does this every New Year''s also.  I have trouble jumping into a pool in the middle of summer!  Then again, any time you can see babes in bikinis in the middle of winter, it can''t be all that bad!  Nice shot -- I''m going to grab another blanket now... :)', '2004-01-10 20:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(538370, 52844, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately cool.  One of my favorites.  I like how there was a little light reflecting on the balls to make the bright strips that follow the balls.   Definately showing some action here, and although I''m not normally a fan of slow shutter speed (simply because it''s rarely in interesting situations) I really do like this.  And it''s nice to see someone who actually knows how to rack.  :)</td>', 'Definately cool.  One of my favorites.  I like how there was a little light reflecting on the balls to make the bright strips that follow the balls.   Definately showing some action here, and although I''m not normally a fan of slow shutter speed (simply because it''s rarely in interesting situations) I really do like this.  And it''s nice to see someone who actually knows how to rack.  :)', '2004-01-10 20:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(538372, 53661, 3080, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for the title, I would not be able to even know what this is.  Actually, even with the title, I''m not really able to make much out of this.  Assuming it''s a person with a football.  The green color is nice, but this doesn''t really show me any action since I really don''t know what it is. Sorry if I don''t see this the way you do. ~Heather~</td>', 'Had it not been for the title, I would not be able to even know what this is.  Actually, even with the title, I''m not really able to make much out of this.  Assuming it''s a person with a football.  The green color is nice, but this doesn''t really show me any action since I really don''t know what it is. Sorry if I don''t see this the way you do. ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(538374, 52646, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but I wish there were more action in it.  you can''t even really tell they are moving except the child looks like she''s stomping in the snow.  You did a wonderful job with the exposure and white balance, which are often difficult in snow shots.  I love how the snow is sitting on the trees.  Looks like Michigan right now. :)  ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but I wish there were more action in it.  you can''t even really tell they are moving except the child looks like she''s stomping in the snow.  You did a wonderful job with the exposure and white balance, which are often difficult in snow shots.  I love how the snow is sitting on the trees.  Looks like Michigan right now. :)  ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 20:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(538378, 53677, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately an action shot.  Love the stopped motion of the water droplets all around the swimmers.  Doesn''t look cold, but I''ll take your word for it.  The lighting is good.  No annoying shadows or bright spots, so it looks like the weather was cooperating even though it was cold.  The angle is good for the shot as well.  I think that it was good to capture the splashes and water droplets.  Good job. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately an action shot.  Love the stopped motion of the water droplets all around the swimmers.  Doesn''t look cold, but I''ll take your word for it.  The lighting is good.  No annoying shadows or bright spots, so it looks like the weather was cooperating even though it was cold.  The angle is good for the shot as well.  I think that it was good to capture the splashes and water droplets.  Good job. ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 20:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(538382, 53680, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really doesn''t look like the subject is moving.  Even the water directly around his feet is pretty still.  The water farther out is what I see movement in, and the water isn''t very interesting at all.  It''s actually a distraction from the bird and crab.  The lighting is nice on the subject.  And I think that the angle is good.  Focus and clarity are also nice.  Just wish there were a bit more movement of the bird and crab.  I guess I could assume the crab is wiggling, but since I''ve never seen this in person, I wouldn''t know if that actually happens. ~Heather~</td>', 'Really doesn''t look like the subject is moving.  Even the water directly around his feet is pretty still.  The water farther out is what I see movement in, and the water isn''t very interesting at all.  It''s actually a distraction from the bird and crab.  The lighting is nice on the subject.  And I think that the angle is good.  Focus and clarity are also nice.  Just wish there were a bit more movement of the bird and crab.  I guess I could assume the crab is wiggling, but since I''ve never seen this in person, I wouldn''t know if that actually happens. ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(538384, 53837, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately shows movement.  It seems kind of grainy, and I assume that''s from the darkness.  I like the slow shutter speed used here.  Not always my favorite effect, but you have done it nicely.  I like how this was taken from a corner, and not directly head on.  Overall a nice action shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately shows movement.  It seems kind of grainy, and I assume that''s from the darkness.  I like the slow shutter speed used here.  Not always my favorite effect, but you have done it nicely.  I like how this was taken from a corner, and not directly head on.  Overall a nice action shot. ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(538386, 53778, 3080, '<td valign="top">this shot does show movement to me.  I almost missed it though.  I thought he was standing on the tower, until I realized his head was hanging a bit far off the edge to be just standing there.  Then I realized his feet, and he''s definately on a mission.  The yellow slide is a bit of a distraction to me.  I wonder how this would look cropped to just above the yellow slide.  Cause right now, the slide is such a bright part of the photo, my eyes keep being drawn to it.  Might put more focus on the dog if the bottom were brought up to crop off the slide.  Worth a try anyway.  ~Heather~</td>', 'this shot does show movement to me.  I almost missed it though.  I thought he was standing on the tower, until I realized his head was hanging a bit far off the edge to be just standing there.  Then I realized his feet, and he''s definately on a mission.  The yellow slide is a bit of a distraction to me.  I wonder how this would look cropped to just above the yellow slide.  Cause right now, the slide is such a bright part of the photo, my eyes keep being drawn to it.  Might put more focus on the dog if the bottom were brought up to crop off the slide.  Worth a try anyway.  ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 21:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(538388, 53760, 3080, '<td valign="top">There''s definately movement, and I love the background.  But I''m a little confused as to why there are roses flying around her head.  They seem pointless there to me.  I think I would personally prefer there to be no roses.  There is great movement in this shot without them, and they dont really add anything to it.  My only other complaint would be the dark side of her face.  Wish there was a bit more lighting there.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are great.  And the angle and placement of the subject are great as well.  ~Heather~</td>', 'There''s definately movement, and I love the background.  But I''m a little confused as to why there are roses flying around her head.  They seem pointless there to me.  I think I would personally prefer there to be no roses.  There is great movement in this shot without them, and they dont really add anything to it.  My only other complaint would be the dark side of her face.  Wish there was a bit more lighting there.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are great.  And the angle and placement of the subject are great as well.  ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 21:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(538391, 53537, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.  I wish the subject were a little more in focus.  I realize it''s an action shot, but I think it would have been just as good as a "stopped motion" shot.  It would have still shown the movement and could have been a bit more in focus.  i like how the surfer is silhouetted.  Nice touch. ~Heather~</td>', 'Good action shot.  I wish the subject were a little more in focus.  I realize it''s an action shot, but I think it would have been just as good as a "stopped motion" shot.  It would have still shown the movement and could have been a bit more in focus.  i like how the surfer is silhouetted.  Nice touch. ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 21:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(538395, 53724, 3080, '<td valign="top">What''s up with the title?  I''m a little confused.  This shot has nothing to do with a butterfly.  The head area is a little dark.  I like the detail on the body, and although it''s not really strong, I can see a bit of movement in the shot.  I like the blue background.</td>', 'What''s up with the title?  I''m a little confused.  This shot has nothing to do with a butterfly.  The head area is a little dark.  I like the detail on the body, and although it''s not really strong, I can see a bit of movement in the shot.  I like the blue background.', '2004-01-10 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(538397, 53643, 3080, '<td valign="top">Shows good action.  Nice panning shot.  I like how well you got him in focus, and the background is nicely blurred.  Love the rosy cheeks...looks like he worked hard to help you with this shot. :) ~Heather~</td>', 'Shows good action.  Nice panning shot.  I like how well you got him in focus, and the background is nicely blurred.  Love the rosy cheeks...looks like he worked hard to help you with this shot. :) ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 21:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(538399, 53755, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately action.  I think the sky is a little blown out toward the left middle of the photo.  I don''t mind the shadows on the people, I think it looks good against the sky.  the angle and framing/cropping are all good as well.  This shot makes me smile. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately action.  I think the sky is a little blown out toward the left middle of the photo.  I don''t mind the shadows on the people, I think it looks good against the sky.  the angle and framing/cropping are all good as well.  This shot makes me smile. ~Heather~', '2004-01-10 21:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(538402, 53816, 15574, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2004-01-10 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(538403, 53729, 15574, '<td valign="top">interesting....</td>', 'interesting....', '2004-01-10 21:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(538405, 53749, 15574, '<td valign="top">very clean action...good job</td>', 'very clean action...good job', '2004-01-10 21:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(538406, 53742, 15574, '<td valign="top">nice action shot...but i feel something is missing....</td>', 'nice action shot...but i feel something is missing....', '2004-01-10 21:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
