(538810, 53834, 280, '<td valign="top">You have a strange white halo around the boy, that makes it look like he has been cut and pasted into the frame, I find this very distracting.</td>', 'You have a strange white halo around the boy, that makes it look like he has been cut and pasted into the frame, I find this very distracting.', '2004-01-11 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(538812, 53642, 280, '<td valign="top">Good shot in crisp focus, but it could have done with a bit of background motion blur or snow flying in the air to give a better impression of speed.</td>', 'Good shot in crisp focus, but it could have done with a bit of background motion blur or snow flying in the air to give a better impression of speed.', '2004-01-11 11:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(538813, 53152, 11895, '<td valign="top">much to like in this one but a bit too highly saturated, the green in the male''s face and the orange of their feet look unnatural<br/> <br/>corrected a typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-08 10:58:27.</i></td>', 'much to like in this one but a bit too highly saturated, the green in the male''s face and the orange of their feet look unnatural corrected a typo', '2004-01-11 11:46:21.000000', '2004-02-08 10:58:27.000000', 1),
(538814, 53742, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good use of motion blur to show the action. looks like fun ;-)</td>', 'Nice shot, good use of motion blur to show the action. looks like fun ;-)', '2004-01-11 11:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(538817, 53748, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of desaturation. The sky looks a little over exposed and I would have prefered a diiferent expresion on the models face, but apart from that a good capture.</td>', 'Nice composition and use of desaturation. The sky looks a little over exposed and I would have prefered a diiferent expresion on the models face, but apart from that a good capture.', '2004-01-11 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(538818, 53439, 280, '<td valign="top">You have frozen the action well, but it is a shame the quality is poor and looks massively sharpened to compensate.</td>', 'You have frozen the action well, but it is a shame the quality is poor and looks massively sharpened to compensate.', '2004-01-11 11:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(538820, 53756, 11895, '<td valign="top">great capture, love the sharp focus, but crop is too tight</td>', 'great capture, love the sharp focus, but crop is too tight', '2004-01-11 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(538821, 53661, 280, '<td valign="top">I dont like this effect at the best of times but here it has been over done, there isnt a single part of this photograph in focus, so much so it would be hard to tell what it is a shot of without the title.</td>', 'I dont like this effect at the best of times but here it has been over done, there isnt a single part of this photograph in focus, so much so it would be hard to tell what it is a shot of without the title.', '2004-01-11 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(538823, 53816, 280, '<td valign="top">I find the leaves in the forground distracting and see little to give the impression of any action.</td>', 'I find the leaves in the forground distracting and see little to give the impression of any action.', '2004-01-11 11:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(538826, 53839, 280, '<td valign="top">Shame we cant see the sea directly bellow the surfer to give a better idea how high he is.</td>', 'Shame we cant see the sea directly bellow the surfer to give a better idea how high he is.', '2004-01-11 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(538840, 53705, 280, '<td valign="top">Interesting sho, butt I find myself wishing I could see more of the person.</td>', 'Interesting sho, butt I find myself wishing I could see more of the person.', '2004-01-11 13:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(538843, 53471, 280, '<td valign="top">The action seems too centrally placed in the frame, maybe pan the camera up slightly to cut out some of the bottom of the frame and include the horizon at the top?</td>', 'The action seems too centrally placed in the frame, maybe pan the camera up slightly to cut out some of the bottom of the frame and include the horizon at the top?', '2004-01-11 14:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(538847, 53656, 280, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, as the sun is behind them, there seems to be little detail on the birds themselves and the branch in the top right hand corner draws my eye away from what the main focus of the shot should be (the birds).</td>', 'Unfortunately, as the sun is behind them, there seems to be little detail on the birds themselves and the branch in the top right hand corner draws my eye away from what the main focus of the shot should be (the birds).', '2004-01-11 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(538849, 52925, 280, '<td valign="top">There is nothing that really makes this photo stand out, I think a white boarder would have framed it better, also you should have cropped out the post at the bottom.</td>', 'There is nothing that really makes this photo stand out, I think a white boarder would have framed it better, also you should have cropped out the post at the bottom.', '2004-01-11 14:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(538850, 53477, 280, '<td valign="top">I think you would have done better to take this shot portrait and stand a little further back to get the full height of the person.</td>', 'I think you would have done better to take this shot portrait and stand a little further back to get the full height of the person.', '2004-01-11 14:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(538851, 53272, 280, '<td valign="top">I dont know how easy it would have been but shots of animals tend to look better when shot at their eye level, try and get as close to the ground as you can when shooting an animal like this.</td>', 'I dont know how easy it would have been but shots of animals tend to look better when shot at their eye level, try and get as close to the ground as you can when shooting an animal like this.', '2004-01-11 14:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
