(538935, 53537, 280, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is lacking slightly, I would prefer the surfer on the right hand side of the image so he would be moving into the photograph. Where he is positioned it looks like he is moving out of the frame especially as the front of the surfboard is copped. However a great capture that I should imagine was difficult to get. 7</td>', 'I think the composition is lacking slightly, I would prefer the surfer on the right hand side of the image so he would be moving into the photograph. Where he is positioned it looks like he is moving out of the frame especially as the front of the surfboard is copped. However a great capture that I should imagine was difficult to get. 7', '2004-01-11 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(538937, 53768, 280, '<td valign="top">I feel that this is cropped too tightly, try standing further back to get the whole of the man in frame. Also I think capturing the player as he throws the ball in to the air and moves the racket to strike it, would be a more pleasing pose.</td>', 'I feel that this is cropped too tightly, try standing further back to get the whole of the man in frame. Also I think capturing the player as he throws the ball in to the air and moves the racket to strike it, would be a more pleasing pose.', '2004-01-11 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(538939, 53787, 280, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the use of the sepia tone, which gives photos a very dated look, however surfing has the feeling of a modern activity. I therefore think black and white may have better suited the image.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the use of the sepia tone, which gives photos a very dated look, however surfing has the feeling of a modern activity. I therefore think black and white may have better suited the image.', '2004-01-11 16:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
