(539067, 52646, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the scene - the snow on the ground, the ice on the trees, but I think it needs to be corpped at the top to emphasize the father and daughter more, and from one side to pull them off center. I know this leaves out a lot of the pretty scenery, but I believe it would make for a stronger composition.</td>', 'I like the scene - the snow on the ground, the ice on the trees, but I think it needs to be corpped at the top to emphasize the father and daughter more, and from one side to pull them off center. I know this leaves out a lot of the pretty scenery, but I believe it would make for a stronger composition.', '2004-01-11 20:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(539071, 53729, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice - you can see the motion, and the metallic luster is well captured.</td>', 'Nice - you can see the motion, and the metallic luster is well captured.', '2004-01-11 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(539073, 53676, 7810, '<td valign="top">oops   the focus looks a little bit soft... On second look, I agree there is a great deal of emotion in the subjects face. Still wish the shot could be a little bit sharper.<br/></td>', 'oops   the focus looks a little bit soft... On second look, I agree there is a great deal of emotion in the subjects face. Still wish the shot could be a little bit sharper.', '2004-01-11 21:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
