(539121, 53742, 15511, '<td valign="top">Did you try this with some flash fill?</td>', 'Did you try this with some flash fill?', '2004-01-11 22:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(539123, 53665, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is nice shot. Kinda wired axing the ice, can only guess that some ice fishing will follow. I like the fire in the FG but can''t figure out which should be the focal point. 8</td>', 'this is nice shot. Kinda wired axing the ice, can only guess that some ice fishing will follow. I like the fire in the FG but can''t figure out which should be the focal point. 8', '2004-01-11 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539124, 53838, 12268, '<td valign="top">coll, creative shot.; Dunno about the yellow BG, maybe black would have been better, IMO. 8</td>', 'coll, creative shot.; Dunno about the yellow BG, maybe black would have been better, IMO. 8', '2004-01-11 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(539125, 52844, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice shot, GREAT idea. 8</td>', 'nice shot, GREAT idea. 8', '2004-01-11 22:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(539127, 53835, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice shot &amp; idea. A black BG might have been better, IMO. 7</td>', 'nice shot & idea. A black BG might have been better, IMO. 7', '2004-01-11 22:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(539128, 53833, 12268, '<td valign="top">very subtle milky feel to it. Good stuff. 7</td>', 'very subtle milky feel to it. Good stuff. 7', '2004-01-11 22:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(539129, 53539, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, a great moment.  I think it could be a bit clearer in some areas when I look closer, and sharper, but of course, this is a very small version I''m sure of the original, and so one can''t expect perfect sharpness and clarity.  Great catch!</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, a great moment.  I think it could be a bit clearer in some areas when I look closer, and sharper, but of course, this is a very small version I''m sure of the original, and so one can''t expect perfect sharpness and clarity.  Great catch!', '2004-01-11 22:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(539131, 53777, 12268, '<td valign="top">doesn;t look like it! Like the idea, seems a bit on th egrainy side though.</td>', 'doesn;t look like it! Like the idea, seems a bit on th egrainy side though.', '2004-01-11 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(539132, 53489, 12253, '<td valign="top">Not what I''d call a real "action" shot, but the timing and scenery is very nice for setting a great morning feeling.</td>', 'Not what I''d call a real "action" shot, but the timing and scenery is very nice for setting a great morning feeling.', '2004-01-11 22:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(539133, 53727, 12253, '<td valign="top">Thats a very good action capture.  Great sharpness, and clarity.  The scenery isn''t as good as it might have been outdoors, wow what a shot this would be with a nicer setting!</td>', 'Thats a very good action capture.  Great sharpness, and clarity.  The scenery isn''t as good as it might have been outdoors, wow what a shot this would be with a nicer setting!', '2004-01-11 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(539135, 53777, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good stop action.  But it would say much more about action if you would have waited another second until the pins were moving!  Also, the front pins are overexposed, but this was I am sure a difficult shot (also I bet it would have been hard to get real stop action pin movement because of the low light and distance involved!)</td>', 'Good stop action.  But it would say much more about action if you would have waited another second until the pins were moving!  Also, the front pins are overexposed, but this was I am sure a difficult shot (also I bet it would have been hard to get real stop action pin movement because of the low light and distance involved!)', '2004-01-11 23:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(539136, 53834, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good panning stop-motion capture!</td>', 'Very good panning stop-motion capture!', '2004-01-11 23:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(539145, 53219, 9906, '<td valign="top">I guess that technically you have captured something in action, but it ain''t really an attractive sight...<br/>TC</td>', 'I guess that technically you have captured something in action, but it ain''t really an attractive sight...TC', '2004-01-11 23:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
