(539235, 53692, 10437, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all the nice comments and the generous votes, it was a fun week<br/>For the curious minds, here you have my explanation<br/>No pasting (illegal), no strobes, no extra flash<br/> <br/>Simply crop, select the background, and apply <br/> <br/>Horizontal motion blur 6 pixels<br/> <br/>As simple as that:-)<br/> <br/>PS The original is in my portfolio</td>', 'Thank you to all the nice comments and the generous votes, it was a fun weekFor the curious minds, here you have my explanationNo pasting (illegal), no strobes, no extra flash Simply crop, select the background, and apply  Horizontal motion blur 6 pixels As simple as that:-) PS The original is in my portfolio', '2004-01-12 00:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
