(539715, 53756, 6008, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, even the ones about the crop near the feet! It actually wasnt a crop, the only crop I did was a little off the top and right side. Out of all the shots I took that day, this one was the more ''action'' type. I actually thought having him tip-toe on the border looked kinda interesting/cute, but I guess not. :(</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, even the ones about the crop near the feet! It actually wasnt a crop, the only crop I did was a little off the top and right side. Out of all the shots I took that day, this one was the more ''action'' type. I actually thought having him tip-toe on the border looked kinda interesting/cute, but I guess not. :(', '2004-01-12 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(539720, 53225, 14035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vadvirag:</b></div><hr/><i>Hey, noone realized that the ornament was spinning? Next time, call it Spinning Ornament. :-) I think more people will associate...<br/> <br/>Great job! It was one of my favourites, it''s amazing how sharp everything is but the ornament has the spinning effect! :-)</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> <br/>Thanks so much for that :) - I didn''t realize the effect was so subtle and was disappointed because I really quite liked this photograph and took some considerable effort setting it up.<br/> <br/>It''s a good lesson in subjectivity, though. Next time I''m getting a second opinion before I post to a challenge :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for the kind comment.<br/> <br/>Catherine<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by vadvirag:Hey, noone realized that the ornament was spinning? Next time, call it Spinning Ornament. :-) I think more people will associate... Great job! It was one of my favourites, it''s amazing how sharp everything is but the ornament has the spinning effect! :-)   Thanks so much for that :) - I didn''t realize the effect was so subtle and was disappointed because I really quite liked this photograph and took some considerable effort setting it up. It''s a good lesson in subjectivity, though. Next time I''m getting a second opinion before I post to a challenge :) Thanks for the kind comment. Catherine', '2004-01-12 12:33:33.000000', NULL, 0),
