(540526, 53363, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi Ben...<br/> <br/>I think you did a great job with this shot.  The exposure looks good and the composition is also nice.  The color of the shirt contrasts very nicely with the dark background.  <br/> <br/>As far as the challenge is concerned, I think you simply suffered from lack of action.  As you are aware, meeting the challenge is a subtle way doesn''t usually get you very far.  <br/> <br/>Excellent work :)</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi Ben... I think you did a great job with this shot.  The exposure looks good and the composition is also nice.  The color of the shirt contrasts very nicely with the dark background.   As far as the challenge is concerned, I think you simply suffered from lack of action.  As you are aware, meeting the challenge is a subtle way doesn''t usually get you very far.   Excellent work :)', '2004-01-12 23:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(540608, 53821, 10084, '<td valign="top">If you had some blurring so it seem that the dinosaur was active or moving would help give it a more action feeling. The sky on this one is really nice. Gives it that "B" movie feeling. <br/> <br/>Maybe if you used a longer shutter speed and using a tripod to sweep the camera (move in the direction that the dino is moving) would blur the dinosaur enough so that it would look like it''s moving. Obviously software can do this, but not legal.</td>', 'If you had some blurring so it seem that the dinosaur was active or moving would help give it a more action feeling. The sky on this one is really nice. Gives it that "B" movie feeling.  Maybe if you used a longer shutter speed and using a tripod to sweep the camera (move in the direction that the dino is moving) would blur the dinosaur enough so that it would look like it''s moving. Obviously software can do this, but not legal.', '2004-01-13 00:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(540681, 53719, 10111, '<td valign="top">love the photo, my only thought is that the picture might have been better if the aircraft were headed toward the camera.  anyway, I would have given it a 9 but didn''t vote in time.,</td>', 'love the photo, my only thought is that the picture might have been better if the aircraft were headed toward the camera.  anyway, I would have given it a 9 but didn''t vote in time.,', '2004-01-13 02:40:08.000000', NULL, 0),
